#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.wrpr_transformation_fail
msgid ""
"<div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"object.get_objects().mapped('child_id')\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list('preferred_name', translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"reminder\" t-value=\"object.search([('config_id', '=', object.config_id.id), ('partner_id', '=', partner.id), ('state', '=', 'done')])\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"/>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Unfortunately, we have not received any feedback from you and will have to cancel the sponsorship for <t t-out=\"firstname\"/>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>We will now look for another sponsor for <t t-out=\"firstname\"/>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Have you changed your mind? Then let us know as soon as possible and increase your sponsorship contribution to CHF 42:\n"
"<a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/my/donations\">link</a>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>The joy of <t t-out=\"firstname\"/> will be enormous!</p>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.wrpr_1_year
msgid ""
"<div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped('child_id')\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list('preferred_name', 3, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"payer\" t-value=\"sum(sponsorships.mapped('total_amount')) and partner in sponsorships.mapped('partner_id')\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"/>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Congratulations, it's been a year since you became the sponsor of <t t-out=\"firstname\"/>!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>A sponsorship is a long-term investment in the life of a child. To learn more, click here: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0eB-8APGpGo\">video</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Thank you for being a part of this mission!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>A Write&amp;Pray sponsorship is a team effort between you and a donor.\n"
"    <t t-if=\"payer\">\n"
"    If you would like to increase your financial support,\n"
"    </t><t t-else=\"\">\n"
"    If you would like to take on CHF 2/5/10 of the financial support yourself,\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    you can do so here: <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/my/donations\">mycompassion</a>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>The team of Compassion</p>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"payer\" t-value=\"sum(sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;total_amount&#x27;)) and partner in sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;partner_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29 or not partner.title.id\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"dein\" t-value=\"&#x27;euer&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dein&#x27;\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"dich\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"dir\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"wp_tchat_url\" t-value=\"&quot;https://mycompassion.ch/de_DE/im_livechat/support/2&quot;\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Gratuliere, nun ist es schon 1 Jahr her, seitdem <t t-out=\"du\"></t>\n"
"<t t-if=\"plural\">\n"
"die Paten\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"<t t-out=\"&quot;die Patin&quot; if partner.gender == &quot;F&quot; else &quot;der Pate&quot;\"></t>\n"
"</t>\n"
"von <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> <t t-out=\"&quot;seid&quot; if plural else &quot;bist&quot;\"></t>!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Eine Patenschaft ist eine langfristige Investition in das Leben eines Kindes. Erfahre hier mehr dazu: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0eB-8APGpGo\">video</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Danke, dass <t t-out=\"du\"></t> Teil dieser Mission <t t-out=\"&quot;seid&quot; if plural else &quot;bist&quot;\"></t>!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Eine Write&amp;Pray Patenschaft ist Teamarbeit eines Spenders und <t t-out=\"dir\"></t>.\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"payer\">\n"
"Falls <t t-out=\"du\"></t> <t t-out=\"deine\"></t> finanzielle Unterstützung erhöhen <t t-out=\"&quot;möchtet&quot; if plural else &quot;möchtest&quot;\"></t>,\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"Falls <t t-out=\"du\"></t> CHF 2.-/5.-/10.- der finanziellen Unterstützung selbst übernehmen <t t-out=\"&quot;möchtet&quot; if plural else &quot;möchtest&quot;\"></t>,\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-out=\"&quot;könnt ihr&quot; if plural else &quot;kannst du&quot;\"></t> dies hier tun: <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/it_IT/my/donations\">mycompassion</a>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Liebe Grüsse<br/>\n"
"Sarah<br/>\n"
"Tel: +41 (0)31 552 21 21<br/>\n"
"Fragen? Melde dich per WhatsApp bei uns: +41 (0)79 622 31 97 \n"
"</p>\n"
"        </body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.wrpr_contribution_reminder_mail
msgid ""
"<div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped('child_id')\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list('preferred_name', translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_reminder\" t-value=\"object.search_count([('config_id','=',object.config_id.id),('partner_id','=',partner.id),('state','=','done),('object_ids','like',sponsorships.ids[:1]),('id','!=',object.id)])\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"/>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Unfortunately, we have not yet received a donation from you for the contribution of the sponsorship that you would like to pay yourself.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"number_reminder\">\n"
"This is already the <t t-out=\"'second' if number_reminder == 1 else 'third'\"/> time that we have contacted you about this. Thank you for taking care of this quickly.\n"
"</t><t t-else=\"\">\n"
"Thank you for taking care of this quickly: <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/my/donation\">MyCompassion</a>.\n"
"</t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Can you not take care of this part yourself? Then contact us so that we can find another donor for it.\n"
"</p>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_reminder\" t-value=\"object.search_count([(&#x27;config_id&#x27;,&#x27;=&#x27;,object.config_id.id),(&#x27;partner_id&#x27;,&#x27;=&#x27;,partner.id),(&#x27;state&#x27;,&#x27;=&#x27;,&#x27;done&#x27;),(&#x27;object_ids&#x27;,&#x27;like&#x27;,sponsorships.ids[:1]),(&#x27;id&#x27;,&#x27;!=&#x27;,object.id)])\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29 or not partner.title.id\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"dein\" t-value=\"&#x27;euer&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dein&#x27;\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"dich\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"dir\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"wp_tchat_url\" t-value=\"&quot;https://mycompassion.ch/de_DE/im_livechat/support/2&quot;\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Leider haben wir von <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> noch keine Spende erhalten für den Teil der <t t-out=\"children.get(&quot;Patenschaft&quot;)\"></t>, den <t t-out=\"du\"></t> selbst zahlen <t t-out=\"&quot;möchtet&quot; if plural else &quot;möchtest&quot;\"></t>.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"number_reminder\">\n"
"Dies ist bereits das <t t-out=\"&quot;zweite&quot; if number_reminder == 1 else &quot;dritte&quot;\"></t> Mal, dass wir uns deswegen bei <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> melden. Danke, dass <t t-out=\"&quot;ihr euch&quot; if plural else &quot;du dich&quot;\"></t> rasch darum <t t-out=\"&quot;kümmert&quot; if plural else &quot;kümmerst&quot;\"></t>.\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"Danke, dass <t t-out=\"&quot;ihr euch&quot; if plural else &quot;du dich&quot;\"></t> rasch darum <t t-out=\"&quot;kümmert&quot; if plural else &quot;kümmerst&quot;\"></t>: <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/my/donation\">MyCompassion</a>.\n"
"</t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p><t t-out=\"&quot;Könnt ihr&quot; if plural else &quot;Kannst du&quot;\"></t> diesen Teil doch nicht selbst übernehmen? Dann <t t-out=\"&quot;meldet euch&quot; if plural else &quot;melde dich&quot;\"></t> bei uns, damit wir einen anderen Spender dafür finden können.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Liebe Grüsse<br/>\n"
"Sarah<br/>\n"
"Tel: +41 (0)31 552 21 21<br/>\n"
"Fragen? <a t-attf-href=\"{{wp_tchat_url}}\"><t t-out=\"wp_tchat_url\"></t></a>\n"
"</p>\n"
"        </body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.wrpr_upgrade_confirmation
msgid ""
"<div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped('child_id')\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list('preferred_name', translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"payer\" t-value=\"sponsorships.filtered('last_paid_invoice_date')\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"payment_mode\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped('payment_mode_id.name')[0]\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"lsv_dd\" t-value=\"'LSV' in payment_mode or 'Postfinance' in payment_mode\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"survey\" t-value=\"object.env['ir.config_parameter'].get_param('web.external.url') + object.env.ref('partner_communication_switzerland.wrpr_journey_survey').get_start_url()\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"/>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Wow, we are happy that you would like to provide financial support for <t t-out=\"firstname\"/>. Thank you very much!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div>\n"
"<t t-if=\"not lsv_dd\">\n"
"<p>In order for you to <t t-out=\"'increase' if payer else 'set up'\"/> your donation for the sponsorship,\n"
"you can find the payment slip here: <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/my/download/sponsorship_bvr\">Download payment slip</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"    <p>Your feedback on the Write &amp; Pray sponsorship is important to us. It takes about 1 minute. Thank you for filling it out: <a t-att-href=\"survey\">Link to survey</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == 'sms'\">\n"
"<p>We will communicate with you by email instead of SMS.\n"
"    <t t-if=\"not partner.email\">\n"
"Thank you for communicating your email address as soon as possible.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == 'digital'\">\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"/>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</div>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<div>\n"
"  <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"  <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"  <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped('child_id')\"/>\n"
"  <t t-set=\"payer\" t-value=\"sponsorships.filtered('last_paid_invoice_date')\"/>\n"
"  <t t-set=\"payment_mode\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped('payment_mode_id.name')[0]\"/>\n"
"  <t t-set=\"lsv_dd\" t-value=\"'LSV' in payment_mode or 'Postfinance' in payment_mode\"/>\n"
"  <t t-set=\"survey\" t-value=\"object.env['ir.config_parameter'].get_param('web.external.url') + object.env.ref('partner_communication_switzerland.wrpr_journey_survey').get_start_url()\"/>\n"
"  <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list('preferred_name', translate=False)\"/>\n"
"  <t t-set=\"amount\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped('group_id')[:1].get_amount('2200-01-01', '2200-02-01', sponsorships)\"/>\n"
"  <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29 or not partner.title.id\"/>\n"
"  <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"'ihr' if plural else 'du'\"/>\n"
"  <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"'eure' if plural else 'deine'\"/>\n"
"  <t t-set=\"dir\" t-value=\"'euch' if plural else 'dir'\"/>\n"
"  <t t-set=\"wp_tchat_url\" t-value=\"'https://mycompassion.ch/de_DE/im_livechat/support/2'\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"  <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"/>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"  Wow, wir freuen uns, dass <t t-out=\"du\"/> CHF <t t-out=\"int(amount)\"/>.- der\n"
"  finanziellen Unterstützung für <t t-out=\"firstname\"/> übernehmen\n"
"  <t t-out=\"'möchtet' if plural else 'möchtest'\"/>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div>\n"
"  <t t-if=\"not lsv_dd\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"      Damit <t t-out=\"du\"/> <t t-out=\"deine\"/> Spende für die\n"
"      <t t-out=\"children.get('Patenschaft')\"/>\n"
"      <t t-out=\"'erhöhen' if payer else 'einrichten'\"/>\n"
"      <t t-out=\"'könnt, findet ihr' if plural else 'kannst, findest du'\"/> hier\n"
"      den Einzahlungsschein:\n"
"      <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/my/download/sponsorship_bvr\">Einzahlungsschein</a>.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"  </t>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"deine.title()\"/> Rückmeldung zur Write&amp;Pray Patenschaft ist\n"
"    uns wichtig. Es dauert knapp 1 Minute. Vielen Dank für’s Ausfüllen!:\n"
"    <a t-att-href=\"survey\">Link to survey</a>.\n"
"  </p>\n"
"  <t t-if=\"object.send_mode == 'sms'\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"      Neu werden wir mit <t t-out=\"dir\"/> per E-Mail statt SMS kommunizieren.\n"
"      <t t-if=\"not partner.email\">\n"
"        Danke, dass <t t-out=\"du\"/> uns <t t-out=\"deine\"/> E-Mail-Adresse so\n"
"        schnell wie möglich <t t-out=\"'mitteilt' if plural else 'mitteilst'\"/>.\n"
"      </t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"  </t>\n"
"  <t t-if=\"object.send_mode == 'digital'\">\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"/>\n"
"  </t>\n"
"  <t t-else=\"\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"      Liebe Grüsse<br/>\n"
"      Sarah<br/>\n"
"      Tel: +41 (0)31 552 21 21<br/>\n"
"      Fragen? <a t-att-href=\"wp_tchat_url\" t-out=\"wp_tchat_url\"/>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"  </t>\n"
"</div>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.wrpr_transformation
msgid ""
"<div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped('child_id')\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list('preferred_name', translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"reminder\" t-value=\"object.search([('config_id', '=', object.config_id.id), ('partner_id', '=', partner.id), ('state', '=', 'done')])\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"/>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>This year you will turn 25, congratulations!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Thank you for supporting <t t-out=\"firstname\"/> with a Write&amp;Pray sponsorship for <t t-out=\"sponsorships[:1].contract_duration//365 or 1\"/> years.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Our Write&amp;Pray sponsorships are for young people under the age of 25. Most sponsors have the financial means to fully resume a sponsorship after that.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>It would be great if you would continue to sponsor <t t-out=\"firstname\"/> for CHF 42.00 per month, so that together we can continue to free children from poverty. You can choose to do so here: <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/my/donations\">link</a>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"reminder\">\n"
"    <p>If we do not receive any feedback from you within the next two weeks, we will unfortunately have to terminate the sponsorship and look for a new sponsor for <t t-out=\"firstname\"/>.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>Have a good day and see you soon!</p>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"reminder\" t-value=\"object.search([(&quot;config_id&quot;, &quot;=&quot;, object.config_id.id), (&quot;partner_id&quot;, &quot;=&quot;, partner.id), (&quot;state&quot;, &quot;=&quot;, &quot;done&quot;)])\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"duration\" t-value=\"sponsorships[:1].contract_duration//365 or 1\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29 or not partner.title.id\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"dein\" t-value=\"&#x27;euer&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dein&#x27;\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"dich\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"dir\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"wp_tchat_url\" t-value=\"&quot;https://mycompassion.ch/de_DE/im_livechat/support/2&quot;\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Dieses Jahr wirst <t t-out=\"du\"></t> 25 Jahre alt. Herzlichen Glückwunsch!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Danke, dass <t t-out=\"du\"></t> <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> seit <t t-out=\"duration\"></t> <t t-out=\"&quot;Jahr&quot; if duration &lt; 2 else &quot;Jahren&quot;\"></t> mit einer Write&amp;Pray Patenschaft unterstützt.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Unsere Write&amp;Pray Patenschaften sind für junge Menschen unter 25 Jahren gedacht, weil die meisten Patinnen und Paten danach über die finanziellen Mittel verfügen, eine Patenschaft ganz zu übernehmen. \n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Wir würden uns sehr freuen, wenn <t t-out=\"du\"></t> hier die <t t-out=\"children.get(&quot;Patenschaft&quot;)\"></t> für <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> für CHF 42.- pro Monat übernehmen <t t-out=\"&quot;würdet&quot; if plural else &quot;würdest&quot;\"></t>, um weiterhin gemeinsam Kinder aus Armut zu befreien: <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/my/donations\">link</a>\n"
"<t t-if=\"reminder\">\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Falls wir von <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> innerhalb der nächsten zwei Wochen keine Rückmeldung erhalten, werden wir die Patenschaft leider beenden müssen und einen neuen Paten für <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> suchen.\n"
"</t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Liebe Grüsse<br/>\n"
"Sarah<br/>\n"
"Tel: +41 (0)31 552 21 21<br/>\n"
"Fragen? Melde dich per WhatsApp bei uns: +41 (0)79 622 31 97\n"
"</p></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.wrpr_transformation_complete
msgid ""
"<div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped('child_id')\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list('preferred_name', translate=False)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"/>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Thank you for deciding to support the sponsorship of <t t-out=\"firstname\"/> financially.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>There is one more thing you can do: Would you take a few minutes to give one or two other teens the opportunity to join the fight against extreme poverty?\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Tell them about your experience as a Write &amp; Pray sponsor and encourage them to do the same.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Together, we can accomplish much more: <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/writeandpray/\">Write&amp;Pray</a>\n"
"</p><p>\n"
"            Thank you so much!\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"/>\n"
"</p>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29 or not partner.title.id\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"dein\" t-value=\"&#x27;euer&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dein&#x27;\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"dich\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Vielen Dank, dass <t t-out=\"du\"></t> <t t-out=\"dich\"></t> entschieden <t t-out=\"&quot;habt&quot; if plural else &quot;hast&quot;\"></t>, die Patenschaft für <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> auch finanziell zu unterstützen.\n"
"\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Es gibt noch etwas, was <t t-out=\"du\"></t> tun <t t-out=\"&quot;könnt: Würdet ihr euch&quot; if plural else &quot;kannst: Würdest du dir&quot;\"></t> ein paar Minuten Zeit nehmen, um ein oder zwei anderen Teenagern die Möglichkeit zu geben, sich am Kampf gegen extreme Armut zu beteiligen?\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Erzähle ihnen von deinen Erfahrungen als Write &amp; Pray-Pate/Patin und ermutige sie, das Gleiche zu tun. \n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Gemeinsam können wir viel mehr erreichen: <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/writeandpray/\">Write&amp;Pray</a>\n"
"</p><p>Vielen Dank! \n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"        </body>\n"
"</html>\n"

