"    <t t-set=\"dein\" t-value=\"&#x27;euer&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dein&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"zoom\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"partner.sponsorship_ids.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"less_4\" t-value=\"firstname != child.get_number()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.informal_salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Die nächste Videokonferenz für neue Patinnen und Paten rückt näher.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"&#x27;Ihr werdet&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Du wirst&#x27;\"></t> sehen, was die Nachricht einer Patenschaft in einer Familie vor Ort auslöst und mehr über <t t-out=\"deine\"></t> eigene<t t-out=\"&quot;n&quot; if len(child) != 1 else &quot;&quot;\"></t> <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;Patenschaft&#x27;)\"></t> erfahren.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"&#x27;Seid ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Bist du&#x27;\"></t> schon angemeldet?\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Die Videokonferenz findet am <t t-out=\"zoom.get_date(&#x27;date_start&#x27;, &#x27;dd/MM/YYYY&#x27;)\"></t> um <t t-out=\"zoom.get_date(&#x27;date_start&#x27;, &#x27;HH:mm&#x27;)\"></t> statt.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div style=\"margin:30px auto; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"    <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/de_DE/zoom/register\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"        Anmeldung Videokonferenz\n"
"    </a>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Danke, dass <t t-out=\"du\"></t> in das Leben von <t t-out=\"firstname if less_4 else deine + &#x27;n Patenkindern&#x27;\"></t> und <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;sein&#x27;)\"></t><t t-out=\"&#x27;er Familie&#x27; if len(child) == 1 else &#x27;en Familien&#x27;\"></t> <t t-out=\"&#x27;investiert&#x27; if plural else &#x27;investierst&#x27;\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Gemeinsam verändern wir das Leben von Kindern - eins nach dem anderen.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Liebe Grüsse\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.short_signature\"></t>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"</p>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.email_sub_accept
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\">\n"
"    <p>TODO</p>\n"
"  <t t-if=\"object.send_mode != 'physical'\"><t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"/></t></div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><div>\n"
"  <t t-set=\"sponsorship\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\" />\n"
"  <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\" />\n"
"  <t t-set=\"others\" t-value=\"partner.sponsorship_ids - sponsorship\" />\n"
"  <t t-set=\"child\" t-value='sponsorship.mapped(\"child_id\")' />\n"
"  <t\n"
"    t-set=\"firstname\"\n"
"    t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, translate=False)\"\n"
"  />\n"
"  <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\" />\n"
"  <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\" />\n"
"  <t t-set=\"dir\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\" />\n"
"  <t t-set=\"dich\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\" />\n"
"  <t t-set=\"dein\" t-value=\"&#x27;euer&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dein&#x27;\" />\n"
"  <t\n"
"    t-set=\"deine\"\n"
"    t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"\n"
"  />\n"
"  <t\n"
"    t-set=\"payment_type_attachement\"\n"
"    t-value='sponsorship.get_payment_type_attachment_string().replace(&#x27;[findet]&#x27;, &#x27;findet ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;findest du&#x27;).replace(&#x27;[dein]&#x27;, dein).replace(&#x27;[deine]&#x27;, deine).replace(&#x27;[dich]&#x27;, dich).replace(&#x27;[Patenschaftsbetrag]&#x27;, &#x27;dem zusätzlichen Patenschaftsbetrag&#x27; if len(child) == 1 else &#x27;den zusätzlichen Patenschaftsbeträgen&#x27;).replace(&#x27;[du]&#x27;, du).replace(&#x27;[kannst]&#x27;, \"könnt\" if plural else \"kannst\").replace(&#x27;[könnt]&#x27;, \"könnt\" if plural else \"kannst\").replace(&#x27;Im Anhang&#x27;, &#x27;Ansonsten&#x27;).replace(&#x27;Wir werden&#x27;, &#x27;Ansonsten werden wir&#x27;)'\n"
"  />\n"
"  <t t-set=\"country\" t-value=\"child.mapped(&#x27;field_office_id&#x27;)\" />\n"
"  <t\n"
"    t-set=\"alumni_name\"\n"
"    t-value=\"country.get_list(&#x27;alumni_representative&#x27;)\"\n"
"  />\n"
"  <t\n"
"    t-set=\"alumni_link\"\n"
"    t-value=\"country.get_list(&#x27;alumni_video_link&#x27;, 1, &#x27;https://vimeo.com/showcase/geschichten-ehemaliger-patenkinder-von-compassion&#x27;)\"\n"
"  />\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"  <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\" />\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"  Herzlichen Dank, dass <t t-out=\"du\" /> <t t-out=\"dich\" /> entschieden\n"
"  <t t-out='\"habt\" if plural else \"hast\"' />, in das Leben eines weiteren Kindes\n"
"  zu investieren.\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if='sponsorship[:1].state != \"active\"'>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"    Falls <t t-out=\"du\" /> <t t-out=\"deine\" /> Spenden nicht bereits eingestellt\n"
"    <t t-out='\"habt\" if plural else \"hast\"' />, können wir die Spenden auf\n"
"    <t t-out=\"firstname\" /> umbuchen.\n"
"    <b>\n"
"      <t\n"
"        t-if='\"Permanent\" in sponsorship[:1].with_context(lang=&#x27;en_US&#x27;).payment_mode_id.name'\n"
"      >\n"
"        <t t-out=\"payment_type_attachement\" />\n"
"        <!--für die Einrichtung eines neuen Dauerauftrages im Anhang.--> </t\n"
"      ><t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        <t\n"
"          t-if='\"BVR\" in sponsorship[:1].with_context(lang=&#x27;en_US&#x27;).payment_mode_id.name'\n"
"        >\n"
"          <t t-out=\"payment_type_attachement\" /> im Anhang. </t\n"
"        ><t t-else=\"\"> <t t-out=\"payment_type_attachement\" />. </t>\n"
"      </t>\n"
"    </b>\n"
"  </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"  Wie bisher <t t-out='\"werdet ihr\" if plural else \"wirst du\"' /> alle\n"
"  Informationen und Fotos von <t t-out=\"deine\" />m Patenkind in\n"
"  <t\n"
"    t-out='\"MyCompassion\" if object.send_mode == \"digital\" else \"www.mycompassion.ch\"'\n"
"  />\n"
"  finden und <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;ihm&#x27;)\" /> schreiben können.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"  <div style=\"margin: 30px auto; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase\">\n"
"    <a\n"
"      href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/de_DE/my/home\"\n"
"      style=\"\n"
"        padding: 12px 18px;\n"
"        font-size: 14px;\n"
"        line-height: 18px;\n"
"        color: #ffffff;\n"
"        border-color: #0054a6;\n"
"        text-decoration: none;\n"
"        display: inline-block;\n"
"        margin-bottom: 0px;\n"
"        font-weight: 400;\n"
"        text-align: center;\n"
"        vertical-align: middle;\n"
"        cursor: pointer;\n"
"        white-space: nowrap;\n"
"        background-image: none;\n"
"        background-color: #0054a6;\n"
"        border: 1px solid #0054a6;\n"
"        border-radius: 3px;\n"
"      \"\n"
"      title=\"\"\n"
"    >\n"
"      MyCompassion\n"
"    </a>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"    Zudem möchten wir <t t-out=\"dir\" /> <t t-out=\"alumni_name\" />,\n"
"    <t\n"
"      t-out=\"&#x27;ehemalige Patenkinder&#x27; if len(country) &gt; 1 else &#x27;ein ehemaliges Patenkind&#x27;\"\n"
"    />\n"
"    von Compassion, vorstellen.\n"
"    <t\n"
"      t-out=\"&#x27;Sie leben&#x27; if len(country) &gt; 1 else (&#x27;Sie lebt&#x27; if child[0].field_office_id.alumni_gender == &#x27;F&#x27; else &#x27;Er lebt&#x27;)\"\n"
"    />\n"
"    auf dem gleichen Kontinent wie <t t-out=\"firstname\" />.\n"
"  </p>\n"
"  <div style=\"margin: 30px auto; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase\">\n"
"    <a\n"
"      t-attf-href=\"{{ alumni_link }}\"\n"
"      style=\"\n"
"        padding: 12px 18px;\n"
"        font-size: 14px;\n"
"        line-height: 18px;\n"
"        color: #ffffff;\n"
"        border-color: #0054a6;\n"
"        text-decoration: none;\n"
"        display: inline-block;\n"
"        margin-bottom: 0px;\n"
"        font-weight: 400;\n"
"        text-align: center;\n"
"        vertical-align: middle;\n"
"        cursor: pointer;\n"
"        white-space: nowrap;\n"
"        background-image: none;\n"
"        background-color: #0054a6;\n"
"        border: 1px solid #0054a6;\n"
"        border-radius: 3px;\n"
"      \"\n"
"      title=\"\"\n"
"    >\n"
"      <t t-out=\"&#x27;Schaut euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Schau dir&#x27;\" />\n"
"      die Geschichte von <t t-out=\"alumni_name\" /> an\n"
"    </a>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<h3 style=\"color: #0054a6; text-transform: uppercase\">\n"
"  <b>\n"
"    <t\n"
"      t-out=\"&#x27;Ihr ermöglicht&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Du ermöglichst&#x27;\"\n"
"    />\n"
"    <t\n"
"      t-out=\"firstname if len(child) &lt; 4 else deine + &#x27;n Patenkindern&#x27;\"\n"
"    />:\n"
"  </b>\n"
"</h3>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"  <li>Zugang zur Schule (Schulgeld, Uniform, Material, Nachhilfe)</li>\n"
"  <li>Bildung (Berufsausbildung oder Unistudium)</li>\n"
"  <li>Medizinische Versorgung</li>\n"
"  <li>Hygieneschulungen und regelmässig ausgewogene Mahlzeiten</li>\n"
"  <li>\n"
"    Liebe und Fürsorge einer lokalen Kirchgemeinde, biblischen Unterricht*\n"
"  </li>\n"
"  <li>Spielerische Förderung der Persönlichkeitsentwicklung</li>\n"
"  <li>Briefkontakt mit <t t-out=\"dir\" /></li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<p style=\"font-size: smaller\">*im Einverständnis der Eltern</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"  Das Kind wird bis zum Ende der Schule, einschliesslich einer Berufsausbildung,\n"
"  aber höchstens bis zum 22. Lebensjahr, begleitet.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if='object.send_mode == \"digital\"'>\n"
"  <div style=\"margin: 30px auto; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase\">\n"
"    <a\n"
"      href=\"https://compassion.ch/de/compassion-weltweit\"\n"
"      style=\"\n"
"        padding: 12px 18px;\n"
"        font-size: 14px;\n"
"        line-height: 18px;\n"
"        color: #ffffff;\n"
"        border-color: #0054a6;\n"
"        text-decoration: none;\n"
"        display: inline-block;\n"
"        margin-bottom: 0px;\n"
"        font-weight: 400;\n"
"        text-align: center;\n"
"        vertical-align: middle;\n"
"        cursor: pointer;\n"
"        white-space: nowrap;\n"
"        background-image: none;\n"
"        background-color: #0054a6;\n"
"        border: 1px solid #0054a6;\n"
"        border-radius: 3px;\n"
"      \"\n"
"      title=\"\"\n"
"    >\n"
"      <t t-out=\"&#x27;Erfahrt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Erfahre&#x27;\" /> mehr\n"
"      über\n"
"      <t\n"
"        t-out=\"&#x27;das Land, in dem&#x27; if len(child.mapped(&#x27;field_office_id&#x27;)) == 1 else &#x27;die Länder, in denen&#x27;\"\n"
"      />\n"
"      <t t-out=\"firstname\" />\n"
"      <t t-out=\"&#x27;lebt&#x27; if len(child) == 1 else &#x27;leben&#x27;\" />\n"
"    </a>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"  Dank <t t-out=\"dir\" /> findet nicht nur ein Kind, sondern eine ganze Familie\n"
"  neue Hoffnung für die Zukunft.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Liebe Grüsse</p>\n"
"<t t-if='object.send_mode == \"digital\"'>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\" />\n"
"    <!-- Sarah -->\n"
"  </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</div>"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.mail_onboarding_step5
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorship\" t-value=\"partner.sponsorship_ids\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorship.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"one_child\" t-value=\"len(child) == 1\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"less_4\" t-value=\"firstname != child.get_number()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"translator\" t-value=\"False\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"event\" t-value=\"False\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"base_url\" t-value=\"object.env[&#x27;ir.config_parameter&#x27;].get_param(&#x27;web.external.url&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-foreach=\"partner.advocate_details_id.engagement_ids\" t-as=\"engagement\">\n"
"        <t t-if=\"engagement.id == 2\">\n"
"            <t t-set=\"translator\" t-value=\"True\"/>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"        <t t-if=\"engagement.id in (1,3,9)\">\n"
"            <t t-set=\"event\" t-value=\"True\"/>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children_in_poverty\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;children_in_poverty&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"early_deaths\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;early_deaths&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_mothers\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_mothers&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_unacceptable_conditions\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_unacceptable_conditions&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.informal_salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"sponsorship.mapped(&#x27;invoice_line_ids&#x27;).filtered(&#x27;last_payment&#x27;) or 0 in sponsorship.mapped(&#x27;total_amount&#x27;)\">\n"
"        Congratulations, your <t t-out=\"&#x27;sponsorship has&#x27; if one_child else &#x27;sponsorships have&#x27;\"></t> started well! The good news has reached <t t-out=\"firstname if less_4 else &#x27;your sponsored children&#x27;\"></t> and <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;his&#x27;)\"></t> <t t-out=\"&#x27;family&#x27; if one_child else &#x27;families&#x27;\"></t>.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    This is the final email you will receive from us concerning the start of your sponsorship.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Your feedback regarding the start of your sponsorship<t t-out=\"&#x27;s&#x27; if not one_child else ''\"></t> is important to us. It should only take 60 seconds.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div style=\"margin:30px auto;text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"    <a t-attf-href=\"{{base_url + object.env.ref('partner_communication_switzerland.onboarding_survey').get_start_url()}}\" style=\"padding:12px 18px;font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\">\n"
"        Take part in the questionnaire\n"
"    </a>\n"
"</div>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"not translator or not event\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Did you know that Compassion is a network of many actively engaged people? This network is made up of you and other sponsors, Compassion staff in different countries and over <t t-out=\"number_fcps\"></t> local church partners in <t t-out=\"number_countries\"></t> countries.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"not translator\">\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            In Switzerland, around 100 volunteers translate numerous letters from sponsors and sponsored children. Would you be interested in helping us?\n"
"        </p>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Many volunteers help in the fight against extreme poverty by participating at Compassion events or church services or through prayer. Do you want to get involved?\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <div style=\"margin:30px auto;text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"        <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/de/sich-mehr-engagieren/\" style=\"padding:12px 18px;font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\">\n"
"            Volunteer\n"
"        </a>\n"
"    </div>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    We would also like to present you our interactive fundraising platform TOGETHER. Here you can start your own project!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div style=\"margin:30px auto;text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"    <a href=\"https://together.compassion.ch/homepage\" style=\"padding:12px 18px;font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\">\n"
"        TOGETHER\n"
"    </a>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Our heartfelt thanks for investing in the <t t-out=\"&#x27;life of &#x27; + firstname if one_child else (&#x27;lives of &#x27; + firstname if less_4 else &#x27;lives of many children&#x27;)\"></t>! We wish you much joy throughout the journey.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Warm regards\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"</p></div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><p>\n"
"  <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"  <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"  <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"'ihr' if plural else 'du'\"/>\n"
"  <t t-set=\"dir\" t-value=\"'euch' if plural else 'dir'\"/>\n"
"  <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"'eure' if plural else 'deine'\"/>\n"
"  <t t-set=\"sponsorship\" t-value=\"partner.sponsorship_ids\"/>\n"
"  <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorship.mapped('child_id')\"/>\n"
"  <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list('preferred_name', 3, child.get_number(), translate=False)\"/>\n"
"  <t t-set=\"less_4\" t-value=\"firstname != child.get_number()\"/>\n"
"  <t t-set=\"translator\" t-value=\"False\"/>\n"
"  <t t-set=\"event\" t-value=\"False\"/>\n"
"  <t t-foreach=\"partner.advocate_details_id.engagement_ids\" t-as=\"engagement\">\n"
"    <t t-if=\"engagement.id == 2\">\n"
"      <t t-set=\"translator\" t-value=\"True\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"engagement.id in (1, 3, 9)\">\n"
"      <t t-set=\"event\" t-value=\"True\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"  </t>\n"
"  <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.env['partner.communication.job'].get_snippet('number_fcps', strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"  <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.env['partner.communication.job'].get_snippet('number_countries', strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"  <t t-set=\"base_url\" t-value=\"object.env['ir.config_parameter'].get_param('web.external.url') + '/de_DE'\"/>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"  <t t-out=\"partner.informal_salutation\"/>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"  <t t-if=\"sponsorship.mapped('invoice_line_ids').filtered('last_payment') or 0 in sponsorship.mapped('total_amount')\">\n"
"    Gratuliere, <t t-out=\"deine\"/>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"'Patenschaft ist' if len(child) == 1 else 'Patenschaften sind'\"/>\n"
"    gut gestartet! Die guten Neuigkeiten haben\n"
"    <t t-out=\"firstname if less_4 else deine + ' Patenkinder'\"/> und\n"
"    <t t-out=\"child.get('seine')\"/> Familie<t t-out=\"'' if len(child) == 1 else 'n'\"/>\n"
"    erreicht.\n"
"  </t>\n"
"  Dies ist die letzte E-Mail, die <t t-out=\"du\"/> von uns zum Start\n"
"  <t t-out=\"deine\"/>r\n"
"  <t t-out=\"'Patenschaft' if len(child) == 1 else 'Patenschaften'\"/>\n"
"  <t t-out=\"'bekommt' if plural else 'bekommst'\"/>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"  <t t-out=\"'Habt ihr' if plural else 'Hast du'\"/> noch Fragen\n"
"  <t t-out=\"'zur Patenschaft' if len(child) == 1 else 'zu den Patenschaften'\"/>? Die Antworten auf häufig gestellte Fragen\n"
"  <t t-out=\"'findet ihr' if plural else 'findest du'\"/> auf unserer\n"
"  <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/de/haeufig-gestellte-fragen/\" title=\"\">\n"
"    Webseite.\n"
"  </a>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"  <t t-out=\"deine.title()\"/> Rückmeldung zum Start der\n"
"  <t t-out=\"child.get('Patenschaft')\"/> ist uns wichtig. Es sollte nicht mehr\n"
"  als 60 Sekunden dauern.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div style=\"margin: 30px auto; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase\">\n"
"  <a t-attf-href=\"{{base_url + object.env.ref('partner_communication_switzerland.onboarding_survey').get_start_url()}}\" style=\"&#10;      padding: 12px 18px;&#10;      font-size: 14px;&#10;      line-height: 18px;&#10;      color: #ffffff;&#10;      border-color: #0054a6;&#10;      text-decoration: none;&#10;      display: inline-block;&#10;      margin-bottom: 0px;&#10;      font-weight: 400;&#10;      text-align: center;&#10;      vertical-align: middle;&#10;      cursor: pointer;&#10;      white-space: nowrap;&#10;      background-image: none;&#10;      background-color: #0054a6;&#10;      border: 1px solid #0054a6;&#10;      border-radius: 3px;&#10;    \">\n"
"    Umfrage starten\n"
"  </a>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<t t-if=\"not translator or not event\">\n"
"  <p>\n"
"    Wusstest <t t-out=\"du\"/>, dass Compassion ein Netzwerk von ganz vielen\n"
"    engagierten Menschen ist? Es besteht aus <t t-out=\"dir\"/> und anderen\n"
"    Patinnen und Paten, aus Compassion Mitarbeitenden in verschiedenen Ländern\n"
"    und Mitarbeitenden von mehr als <t t-out=\"number_fcps\"/> lokalen\n"
"    Partnerkirchen in <t t-out=\"number_countries\"/> Ländern.\n"
"  </p>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"not translator\">\n"
"      In der Schweiz übersetzen rund 100 Freiwillige zahlreiche Briefe von\n"
"      Patinnen, Paten und Patenkindern.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"not event\">\n"
"      Viele Freiwillige unterstützen den Kampf gegen extreme Armut durch ihre\n"
"      Mithilfe an Veranstaltungen und Gottesdiensten und durch Gebet.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"'Seid ihr' if plural else 'Bist du'\"/> interessiert, mitzuhelfen?\n"
"  </p>\n"
"  <div style=\"margin: 30px auto; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase\">\n"
"    <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/de/sich-mehr-engagieren/\" style=\"&#10;        padding: 12px 18px;&#10;        font-size: 14px;&#10;        line-height: 18px;&#10;        color: #ffffff;&#10;        border-color: #0054a6;&#10;        text-decoration: none;&#10;        display: inline-block;&#10;        margin-bottom: 0px;&#10;        font-weight: 400;&#10;        text-align: center;&#10;        vertical-align: middle;&#10;        cursor: pointer;&#10;        white-space: nowrap;&#10;        background-image: none;&#10;        background-color: #0054a6;&#10;        border: 1px solid #0054a6;&#10;        border-radius: 3px;&#10;      \" title=\"\">\n"
"      Freiwillig mithelfen\n"
"    </a>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"  Wir stellen <t t-out=\"dir\"/> auch noch unsere interaktive\n"
"  Fundraising-Plattform TOGETHER vor. Hier\n"
"  <t t-out=\"'könnt ihr' if plural else 'kannst du'\"/> ein eigenes Projekt\n"
"  starten!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div style=\"margin: 30px auto; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase\">\n"
"  <a href=\"https://together.compassion.ch/de_DE/homepage\" style=\"&#10;      padding: 12px 18px;&#10;      font-size: 14px;&#10;      line-height: 18px;&#10;      color: #ffffff;&#10;      border-color: #0054a6;&#10;      text-decoration: none;&#10;      display: inline-block;&#10;      margin-bottom: 0px;&#10;      font-weight: 400;&#10;      text-align: center;&#10;      vertical-align: middle;&#10;      cursor: pointer;&#10;      white-space: nowrap;&#10;      background-image: none;&#10;      background-color: #0054a6;&#10;      border: 1px solid #0054a6;&#10;      border-radius: 3px;&#10;    \" title=\"\">\n"
"    TOGETHER\n"
"  </a>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"  Herzlichen Dank, dass <t t-out=\"du\"/> in das Leben von\n"
"  <t t-out=\"firstname if less_4 else deine + 'n Patenkindern'\"/>\n"
"  <t t-out=\"'investiert' if plural else 'investierst'\"/>! Wir wünschen\n"
"  <t t-out=\"dir\"/> viel Freude dabei.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Liebe Grüsse</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"  <t t-if=\"object.send_mode != 'physical'\"><t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"/></t><t t-else=\"\"><t t-out=\"object.user_id.short_signature\"/></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"</div>"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.mail_onboarding_step4
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorship\" t-value=\"partner.sponsorship_ids\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorship.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"one_child\" t-value=\"len(child) == 1\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"less_4\" t-value=\"firstname != child.get_number()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"christmas_time\" t-value=\"(datetime.date.today().month)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"field_office_ids\" t-value=\"child.mapped(&#x27;field_office_id&#x27;).ids\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"special\" t-value=\"1 in field_office_ids or 19 in field_office_ids\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.informal_salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Your letters and prayers make a difference in the <t t-out=\"&#x27;life of your sponsored child&#x27; if one_child else &#x27;lives of your sponsored children&#x27;\"></t>!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    In a letter from her sponsors, Michelle from the Philippines read for the first time in her life the words \"You are beautiful, you are precious, we love you\". Today, over 25 years later, the impact of letter exchanges with her sponsors is still evident: Michelle has started an aid organisation to help victims of prostitution and human trafficking.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Why not write a letter and send a photo to <t t-out=\"firstname if less_4 else &#x27;your sponsored children&#x27;\"></t> for <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"></t> to get to know you better. You can write via <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/en_US/my/letter\">MyCompassion</a>.\n"
"    <t t-if=\"christmas_time &gt; 8\">\n"
"        Why not send your sponsored child<t t-out=\"&#x27;ren&#x27; if not one_child else &#x27;&#x27;\"></t> a Christmas card now?\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Do you need inspiration?</p>\n"
"<div style=\"margin:20px auto; text-align: center;\">\n"
"    <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/de/was-soll-ich-meinem-patenkind-schreiben/\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"        5 ideas for letter writing\n"
"    </a>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<t t-if=\"special\">\n"
"    <p>Extra information on writing letters to your sponsored <t t-out=\"&#x27;child&#x27; if len(child) == 1 else &#x27;children&#x27;\"></t>.</p>\n"
"    <div style=\"margin:20px auto; text-align: center;\">\n"
"        <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/medias/onboarding/BD_SL_child_communication_EN.pdf\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"            Information about letter writing:\n"
"        </a>\n"
"    </div>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Another important letter writing information: To ensure the protection of the children, but also for your own safety, the communication between you and your sponsored child<t t-out=\"&#x27;ren&#x27; if not one_child else &#x27;&#x27;\"></t> must run solely through us.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Please never mention:<br/></p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"    <li>Your postal address</li>\n"
"    <li>Your email address</li>\n"
"    <li>Your phone number</li>\n"
"    <li>Compassion Switzerland's address</li>\n"
"    <li>Your Facebook or other social media contact details</li>\n"
"    <li>Making promises (e.g. a gift or visit)</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    It's so wonderful that you're investing in the <t t-out=\"&#x27;life of &#x27; + firstname if one_child else &#x27;lives of your sponsored children&#x27;\"></t>!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Warm regards,</p>\n"
"<p><t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t></p></div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dir\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dich\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dein\" t-value=\"&#x27;euer&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dein&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorship\" t-value=\"partner.sponsorship_ids\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorship.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"less_4\" t-value=\"firstname != child.get_number()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dein_patenkind\" t-value=\"child.get(&#x27;euer Patenkind&#x27;) if plural else child.get(&#x27;dein Patenkind&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"christmas_time\" t-value=\"(datetime.date.today().month)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"field_office_ids\" t-value=\"child.mapped(&#x27;field_office_id&#x27;).ids\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"special\" t-value=\"1 in field_office_ids or 19 in field_office_ids\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.informal_salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"deine.title()\"></t> Briefe und Gebete machen einen Unterschied im Leben <t t-out=\"deine + &#x27;s&#x27; if len(child) == 1 else deine + &#x27;r&#x27;\"></t>  <t t-out=\"&#x27;Patenkindes&#x27; if len(child) == 1 else &#x27;Patenkinder&#x27;\"></t>!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    In einem Brief ihrer Paten \"hörte\" Michelle auf den Philippinen zum ersten Mal in ihrem Leben die Worte \"Du bist schön, du bist wertvoll, wir haben dich lieb\". Heute, mehr als 25 Jahre später, zeigt sich immer noch, wie sich der Austausch mit ihren Paten auf ihr Leben ausgewirkt hat: Michelle hat selbst ein Hilfswerk für Opfer von Prostitution und Menschenhandel ins Leben gerufen.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Damit <t t-out=\"firstname if less_4 else dein_patenkind\"></t> <t t-out=\"dich\"></t> besser <t t-out=\"&#x27;kennenlernt&#x27; if len(child) == 1 else &#x27;kennenlernen&#x27;\"></t>, <t t-out=\"&#x27;könnt ihr euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;kannst du dich&#x27;\"></t> mit einem Foto und einem Brief vorstellen.  Schreiben <t t-out=\"&#x27;könnt ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;kannst du&#x27;\"></t> über\n"
"    <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/de_DE/my/letter\"> MyCompassion</a>.\n"
"    <t t-if=\"christmas_time &gt; 9\">\n"
"         Sende deinem Patenkind schon jetzt einen Weihnachtsgruss!\n"
"     </t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"&#x27;Braucht ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Brauchst du&#x27;\"></t> Inspiration dazu?\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div style=\"margin:20px auto; text-align: center;\">\n"
"    <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/de/was-soll-ich-meinem-patenkind-schreiben/\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"        5 Ideen zum Briefeschreiben\n"
"    </a>\n"
"</div>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"special\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Besondere Informationen zum Briefeschreiben für <t t-out=\"dein if len(child) == 1 else deine\"></t>  <t t-out=\"&#x27;Patenkind&#x27; if len(child)==1 else &#x27;Patenkinder&#x27;\"></t>.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <div style=\"margin:20px auto; text-align: center;\">\n"
"        <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/medias/onboarding/BD_SL_child_communication_de.pdf\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"            Informationen zum Briefeschreiben\n"
"        </a>\n"
"    </div>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Hier noch eine wichtige Information: Zum Schutz der Kinder, aber auch zu <t t-out=\"deine\"></t>m Schutz, läuft die Kommunikation zwischen <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> und <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;eurem Patenkind&#x27;) if plural else child.get(&#x27;deinem Patenkind&#x27;)\"></t> ausschliesslich über uns.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Bitte <t t-out=\"&#x27;erwähnt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;erwähne&#x27;\"></t> nie:\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"deine\"></t> Postadresse\n"
"    </li>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"deine\"></t> E-Mail Adresse\n"
"    </li>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"deine\"></t> Telefonnummer\n"
"    </li>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        die Adresse von Compassion Schweiz\n"
"    </li>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"deine\"></t> Kontaktdaten von Facebook oder anderen sozialen Medien\n"
"    </li>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"&#x27;Macht&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Mache&#x27;\"></t> keine Versprechen, bspw. für ein Geschenk oder einen Besuch\n"
"    </li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Es ist einfach grossartig, dass <t t-out=\"du\"></t> in das Leben <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;dieses Kindes&#x27;)\"></t> <t t-out=\"&#x27;investiert&#x27; if plural else &#x27;investierst&#x27;\"></t>!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Liebe Grüsse\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"</p></div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.mail_onboarding_step3
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorship\" t-value=\"partner.sponsorship_ids\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorship.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"one_child\" t-value=\"len(child) == 1\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.informal_salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    This is the third of five emails that you will receive from us.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    What does poverty mean in the life of your sponsored child<t t-out=\"&#x27;ren&#x27; if not one_child else &#x27;&#x27;\"></t>?\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    The causes and effects of poverty can differ depending on the context.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Compassion is active in areas where life is extremely difficult. Be it in Central America, where families live with the danger of gang violence on a daily basis; Africa, where diseases, alcohol, drugs dominate every day life; or Asia, where children are threatened with prostitution or child labour.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Every child deserves to be able to go to school, be protected and experience a childhood filled with hope for the future.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    This is an important part of Compassion's work. <b>A sponsorship protects a child from child labour and other forms of slavery, particularly from gang violence and forced marriage.</b>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Together we can protect children!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div style=\"margin:30px auto; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"    <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/de/kinderschutz\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"        More information on child protection\n"
"    </a>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Warm regards,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"</div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorship\" t-value=\"partner.sponsorship_ids\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorship.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dir\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dich\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dein\" t-value=\"&#x27;euer&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dein&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.informal_salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Das ist die dritte der insgesamt fünf angekündigten E-Mails.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Was bedeutet Armut im Leben <t t-out=\"deine + &#x27;s Patenkindes&#x27; if len(child) == 1 else deine + &#x27;r Patenkinder&#x27;\"></t>?\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Die Ursachen und Auswirkungen von Armut sind je nach Kontext unterschiedlich.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Es gibt städtische und ländliche Armut. Jeden Tag kommen 7 Millionen Menschen auf der Suche nach Arbeit in Metropolen an und sammeln sich in den Slums. Sie sind schutzbedürftig und den schlimmsten Formen von Armut und Ausbeutung ausgesetzt. Auf dem Land ist das Leben hart und die Arbeitsaussichten sind begrenzt.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Compassion ist an Orten aktiv, wo das Leben extrem schwierig ist, sei es in Mittelamerika, wo die Familien täglich der Gefahr ausgehend durch Bandengewalt ausgesetzt sind, in Afrika, wo Krankheiten, Alkohol, Drogen den Alltag beherrschen, oder in Asien, wo Kinder von Prostitution oder Kinderarbeit bedroht sind.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Jedes Kind verdient es, zur Schule gehen zu können, geschützt zu werden und eine Kindheit mit Hoffnung und Zukunft zu erleben.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Dies ist ein wichtiger Teil der Arbeit von Compassion. Eine Patenschaft schützt vor Kinderarbeit und anderen Formen der Sklaverei, insbesondere vor Bandengewalt und Zwangsheirat.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Gemeinsam können wir Kinder schützen!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div style=\"margin:30px auto; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"    <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/de/kinderschutz\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"        Mehr Informationen zum kinderschutz\n"
"    </a>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Liebe Grüsse\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"object.send_mode != 'physical'\"><t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"/></t><t t-else=\"\"><t t-out=\"object.user_id.short_signature\"/></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"</div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.email_sponsorship_sub_dossier_new
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"one_child\" t-value=\"len(child) == 1\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"previous\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;parent_id.child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"previous_name\" t-value=\"previous.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, &#x27;&#x27;, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"name\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"he\" t-value=\"child.get(&#x27;he&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"He\" t-value=\"he[:1].upper() + he[1:]\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"his\" t-value=\"child.get(&#x27;his&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"him\" t-value=\"child.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"payment_term\" t-value=\"(sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;payment_mode_id.name&#x27;) or [&#x27;&#x27;])[0]\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"lsv_dd\" t-value=\"&#x27;LSV&#x27; in payment_term or &#x27;Postfinance&#x27; in payment_term\"/>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-if=\"previous_name\">Thank you so much for investing in the life of <t t-out=\"previous_name\"></t>. </t>After a sponsorship ends, one of the most wonderful parts of our work is connecting a child living in extreme poverty with a sponsor.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <b>We are delighted to introduce <t t-out=\"name\"></t><t t-if=\"one_child\">, <t t-out=\"child[:1].age\"></t> years old</t>, from <t t-out=\"child.get_list(&#x27;project_id.country_id.name&#x27;)\"></t>.</b> <t t-out=\"He\"></t> <t t-out=\"&#x27;is&#x27; if one_child else &#x27;are&#x27;\"></t> waiting for a sponsor like you.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Every child is unique and deserves a future full of hope and opportunity. The enclosed information will help you get to know <t t-out=\"name\"></t> a little better. See <t t-out=\"his\"></t> challenges and dreams, and how you can support <t t-out=\"him\"></t>.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Most sponsors decide to support a new child. That is why we have made it as easy as possible to take over the sponsorship of <t t-out=\"name\"></t>. <b>Would you be ready to sponsor <t t-out=\"him\"></t>?</b>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-if=\"lsv_dd\">\n"
"            If you have not yet cancelled your direct debit, you do not need to do anything. We will take care of everything so that this sponsorship can start. The sponsorship donation will continue to be debited as usual.\n"
"        </t>\n"
"        <t t-else=\"\">\n"
"            If you have not yet cancelled your standing order, you do not need to do anything. We will take care of everything so that this sponsorship can start.\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <b>\n"
"            If we should look for another sponsor for <t t-out=\"name\"></t>, or if you wish to support another child, please contact us by e-mail or by phone within the next two weeks. If we do not hear from you, we will assume that you wish to support <t t-out=\"&#x27;this child&#x27; if one_child else &#x27;these children&#x27;\"></t>, so that you can continue your commitment in the fight against extreme poverty.\n"
"        </b>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        We look forward to announcing the good news of this sponsorship to <t t-out=\"name\"></t>. Thank you for investing in the lives of children living in extreme poverty.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Best regards,\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"        <p t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"previous\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;parent_id.child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"previous_name\" t-value=\"previous.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, &#x27;&#x27;, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"names\" t-value=\"children.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, &#x27;&#x27;, False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dir\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dich\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dein\" t-value=\"&#x27;euer&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dein&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deinen\" t-value=\"&#x27;euren&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deinen&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"Stell\" t-value=\"&#x27;Stellt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Stell&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"bist\" t-value=\"&#x27;seid&#x27; if plural else &#x27;bist&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"kannst\" t-value=\"&#x27;könnt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;kannst&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"hast\" t-value=\"&#x27;habt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;hast&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"musst\" t-value=\"&#x27;müsst&#x27; if plural else &#x27;musst&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"one_child\" t-value=\"len(children) == 1\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"jahre\" t-value=\"&#x27;Jahr&#x27; if children[:1].age == 1 else &#x27;Jahre&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"patenschaft\" t-value=\"&#x27;die Patenschaft&#x27; if one_child else &#x27;die Patenschaften&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"payment_term\" t-value=\"(sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;payment_mode_id.name&#x27;) or [&#x27;&#x27;])[0]\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"lsv_dd\" t-value=\"&#x27;LSV&#x27; in payment_term or &#x27;Postfinance&#x27; in payment_term\"/>\n"
"\n"
"<p t-out=\"partner.salutation\"/>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"previous_name\">\n"
"        Herzlichen Dank, dass <t t-out=\"du\"></t> in das Leben von <t t-out=\"previous_name\"></t> investiert <t t-out=\"hast\"></t>.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    Sobald eine Patenschaft an ein Ende gekommen ist, ist etwas vom Schönsten unserer Arbeit, wartende Kinder, welche in extremer Armut leben, mit\n"
"    <t t-if=\"plural\">\n"
"        einer Patenfamilie\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        <t t-out=\"&quot;einer Patin&quot; if partner.gender == &quot;F&quot; else &quot;einem Paten&quot;\"></t>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    zu verbinden.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"len(children) == 1\">\n"
"        <b>Wir freuen uns, <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> <t t-out=\"names\"></t> <t t-out=\"children.get_list(&#x27;project_id.country_id.in_preposition&#x27;)\"></t> <t t-out=\"children.get_list(&#x27;project_id.country_id.name&#x27;)\"></t> vorzustellen</b>. <t t-out=\"names\"></t> ist <t t-out=\"children[:1].age\"></t> <t t-out=\"jahre\"></t> alt und wartet auf\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        <b>Wir freuen uns, <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> die Kinder <t t-out=\"names\"></t> vorzustellen</b>. Sie warten auf\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"plural\">\n"
"        eine Patenfamilie\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        <t t-out=\"&quot;eine Patin&quot; if partner.gender == &quot;F&quot; else &quot;einen Paten&quot;\"></t>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    wie <t t-out=\"dich\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Jedes Kind ist einzigartig und hat das Recht auf eine Zukunft voller Hoffnung und Perspektive. Gerne <t t-out=\"kannst\"></t> <t t-out=\"du\"></t>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"len(children) == 1\">\n"
"        <t t-out=\"names\"></t>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        die Kinder\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    anhand der beigefügten Informationen besser kennenlernen. <t t-out=\"Stell\"></t> <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> einmal\n"
"    <t t-if=\"len(children) == 1\">\n"
"        <t t-out=\"children.get(&#x27;seine&#x27;)\"></t> Herausforderungen und Träume vor und wie <t t-out=\"du\"></t> <t t-out=\"children.get(&#x27;ihn&#x27;)\"></t>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        ihre Herausforderungen und Träume vor und wie <t t-out=\"du\"></t> sie\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    darin ermutigen und unterstützen <t t-out=\"&quot;könnt&quot; if plural else &quot;kannst&quot;\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Die meisten unserer Patinnen und Paten entscheiden sich, weitere Kinder zu unterstützen. Deswegen wollen wir\n"
"    es <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> so einfach wie möglich machen, die Patenschaft für <t t-out=\"names\"></t> zu übernehmen. <b><t t-out=\"&#x27;Wärt ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Wärst du&#x27;\"></t> bereit, <t t-out=\"patenschaft\"></t> zu übernehmen?</b>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"lsv_dd\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Falls <t t-out=\"du\"></t> <t t-out=\"dein\"></t> Lastschriftverfahren noch nicht eingestellt <t t-out=\"hast\"></t>, <t t-out=\"musst\"></t> <t t-out=\"du\"></t> nichts weiter tun.\n"
"        Wir werden uns um alles Nötige kümmern und <t t-out=\"patenschaft\"></t> starten, indem wir <t t-out=\"dein\"></t> Konto weiterhin\n"
"        belasten.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Falls <t t-out=\"du\"></t> <t t-out=\"deinen\"></t> Dauerauftrag noch nicht eingestellt <t t-out=\"hast\"></t>, <t t-out=\"musst\"></t> <t t-out=\"du\"></t> nichts weiter tun. Wir\n"
"        werden uns um alles Nötige kümmern und <t t-out=\"patenschaft\"></t> starten.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <b>\n"
"        Falls wir für <t t-out=\"names\"></t>\n"
"        <t t-if=\"plural\">\n"
"            eine andere Patenfamilie\n"
"        </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"            <t t-out=\"&quot;eine andere Patin&quot; if partner.gender == &quot;F&quot; else &quot;einen anderen Paten&quot;\"></t>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"        suchen sollen oder <t t-out=\"du\"></t> gerne andere Kinder unterstützen <t t-out=\"&quot;möchtet, meldet euch&quot; if plural else &quot;möchtest, melde dich&quot;\"></t> bitte innerhalb der nächsten zwei Wochen per E-Mail oder Anruf bei uns. Ansonsten\n"
"        gehen wir davon aus, dass <t t-out=\"du\"></t> mit <t t-out=\"&#x27;der neuen Patenschaft&#x27; if one_child else &#x27;den neuen Patenschaften&#x27;\"></t> einverstanden <t t-out=\"bist\"></t>.\n"
"    </b>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Herzlichen Dank, dass <t t-out=\"du\"></t> in das Leben von Kindern in extremer Armut <t t-out=\"&quot;investiert&quot; if plural else &quot;investierst&quot;\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Liebe Grüsse\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"    <p t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"/>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"
"\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.mail_onboarding_step2
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><p>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorship\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorship.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, &#x27;your sponsored children&#x27;, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"country\" t-value=\"child.mapped(&#x27;field_office_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"alumni_name\" t-value=\"country.get_list(&#x27;alumni_representative&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"apos\" t-value=\"&quot;&#x27;&quot; if alumni_name[-1] == &#x27;s&#x27; else &quot;&#x27;s&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"alumni_link\" t-value=\"country.get_list(&#x27;alumni_video_link&#x27;, 1, &#x27;https://vimeo.com/showcase/geschichten-ehemaliger-patenkinder-von-compassion&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"multi_link\" t-value=\"alumni_link == &#x27;https://vimeo.com/showcase/geschichten-ehemaliger-patenkinder-von-compassion&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>, your sponsorship is making a difference!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"not multi_link\">\n"
"        Today, we would like to introduce you to <t t-out=\"alumni_name\"></t>, a former sponsored child of Compassion. <t t-out=\"&#x27;She&#x27; if child[0].field_office_id.alumni_gender == &#x27;F&#x27; else &#x27;He&#x27;\"></t> lives on the same continent as <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        Today, we would like to introduce you to <t t-out=\"alumni_name\"></t>, former sponsored children of Compassion. They on the same continent as <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div style=\"margin:30px auto; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"    <a t-attf-href=\"{{alumni_link}}\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">Discover\n"
"    <t t-if=\"multi_link\">\n"
"        their stories\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        <t t-out=\"alumni_name + apos\"></t> story\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    </a>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<h3 style=\"color: #0054A6; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"    <b>You enable <t t-out=\"firstname if len(child) &lt; 4 else &#x27;your sponsored children&#x27;\"></t>:</b>\n"
"</h3>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"    <li>Access to school (school fees, uniform, material, tutoring)</li>\n"
"    <li>Higher education (vocational training or university studies)</li>\n"
"    <li>Medical care</li>\n"
"    <li>Hygiene training and regular balanced meals</li>\n"
"    <li>Love and care from a local church, bible teaching*</li>\n"
"    <li>Encouragement to explore their personality as they learn and play</li>\n"
"    <li>Letter contact with you</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<p style=\"font-size: smaller\">\n"
"    *In agreement with the child's parents\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>The child will be supported until the end of school, including vocational training, but at most until the age of 22.</p>\n"
"<div style=\"margin:30px auto; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"    <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/de/compassion-weltweit\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"        Get to know more about the country where <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> <t t-out=\"&#x27;lives&#x27; if len(child) == 1 else &#x27;live&#x27;\"></t>\n"
"    </a>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>Thanks to you, not only a child, but a whole family can find new hope for the future.</p>\n"
"<p>Warm regards,</p>\n"
"<p><t t-if=\"object.send_mode != 'physical'\"><t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"/></t><t t-else=\"\"><t t-out=\"object.user_id.short_signature\"/></t></p></div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dir\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dich\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dein\" t-value=\"&#x27;euer&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dein&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorship\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorship.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, deine + &#x27; Patenkinder&#x27;, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"country\" t-value=\"child.mapped(&#x27;field_office_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"alumni_name\" t-value=\"country.get_list(&#x27;alumni_representative&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"alumni_link\" t-value=\"country.get_list(&#x27;alumni_video_link&#x27;, 1, &#x27;https://vimeo.com/showcase/geschichten-ehemaliger-patenkinder-von-compassion&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"multi_link\" t-value=\"alumni_link == &#x27;https://vimeo.com/showcase/geschichten-ehemaliger-patenkinder-von-compassion&#x27;\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.informal_salutation\"></t>, <t t-out=\"deine\"></t> <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;Patenschaft&#x27;)\"></t> <t t-out=\"&#x27;wirkt&#x27; if len(child) == 1 else &#x27;wirken&#x27;\"></t>!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"not multi_link\">\n"
"        Heute möchten wir <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> <t t-out=\"alumni_name\"></t>, ein ehemaliges Patenkind von Compassion, vorstellen. <t t-out=\"&#x27;Sie&#x27; if child[0].field_office_id.alumni_gender == &#x27;F&#x27; else &#x27;Er&#x27;\"></t> lebt auf dem gleichen Kontinent wie <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        Heute möchten wir <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> <t t-out=\"alumni_name\"></t>, ehemalige Patenkinder von Compassion, vorstellen. Sie leben auf den gleichen Kontinenten wie <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div style=\"margin:30px auto; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"    <a t-attf-href=\"{{alumni_link}}\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"        <t t-out=\"&#x27;Schaut euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Schau dir&#x27;\"></t>\n"
"        <t t-if=\"multi_link\">\n"
"            ihre Geschichten an\n"
"        </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"            die Geschichte von <t t-out=\"alumni_name\"></t> an\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </a>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<h3 style=\"color: #0054A6; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"    <b>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"&#x27;Ihr ermöglicht&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Du ermöglichst&#x27;\"></t> <t t-out=\"firstname if len(child) &lt; 4 else deine + &#x27;n Patenkindern&#x27;\"></t>:\n"
"    </b>\n"
"</h3>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        Zugang zur Schule (Schulgeld, Uniform, Material, Nachhilfe)\n"
"    </li>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        Bildung (Berufsausbildung oder Unistudium)\n"
"    </li>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        Medizinische Versorgung\n"
"    </li>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        Hygieneschulungen und regelmässig ausgewogene Mahlzeiten\n"
"    </li>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        Liebe und Fürsorge einer lokalen Kirchgemeinde, biblischen Unterricht*\n"
"    </li>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        Spielerische Förderung der Persönlichkeitsentwicklung\n"
"    </li>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        Briefkontakt mit <t t-out=\"dir\"></t>\n"
"    </li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<p style=\"font-size: smaller\">\n"
"    *im Einverständnis der Eltern\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Jedes Kind wird bis zum Ende der Schule, einschliesslich einer Berufsausbildung, aber höchstens bis zum 22. Lebensjahr, begleitet.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div style=\"margin:30px auto; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"    <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/de/compassion-weltweit\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"        <t t-out=\"&#x27;Erfahrt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Erfahre&#x27;\"></t> mehr über <t t-out=\"&#x27;das Land, in dem&#x27; if len(child.mapped(&#x27;field_office_id&#x27;)) == 1 else &#x27;die Länder, in denen&#x27;\"></t> <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> <t t-out=\"&#x27;lebt&#x27; if len(child) == 1 else &#x27;leben&#x27;\"></t>\n"
"    </a>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Dank <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> findet nicht nur ein Kind, sondern eine ganze Familie neue Hoffnung für die Zukunft.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Liebe Grüsse\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"</div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.mail_onboarding_sponsorship_confirmation
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><p>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"len(sponsorships) &gt; 1\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"has\" t-value=\"&#x27;have&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"has\" t-value=\"&#x27;has&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"others\" t-value=\"partner.sponsorship_ids - sponsorships\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"wp\" t-value=\"&quot;SWP&quot; in sponsorships.mapped(&quot;type&quot;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"payer\" t-value=\"object.partner_id in sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;partner_id&#x27;) and len(sponsorships.filtered(&#x27;period_paid&#x27;)) != len(sponsorships)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, children.get_number(), translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"less_3\" t-value=\"firstname != children.get_number()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"apos\" t-value=\"&quot;&#x27;&quot; if firstname[-1] == &#x27;s&#x27; else &quot;&#x27;s&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"payment_attachment\" t-value=\"sponsorships.get_payment_type_attachment_string()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"is_new\" t-value=\"sponsorships.filtered(&quot;is_first_sponsorship&quot;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children_in_poverty\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;children_in_poverty&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"early_deaths\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;early_deaths&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_mothers\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_mothers&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_unacceptable_conditions\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_unacceptable_conditions&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</p><p>\n"
"</p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"is_new\">\n"
"        It's so nice to have you as part of the Compassion family!\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        Thank you so much for deciding to sponsor <t t-out=\"&#x27;more children&#x27; if plural else &#x27;another child&#x27;\"></t>.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    With your help alongside around <t t-out=\"number_fcps\"></t> partner churches we are currently releasing over <t t-out=\"number_children\"></t> million children from poverty in <t t-out=\"number_countries\"></t> countries. Together we enable children to have a life with hope and a future.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"payer\">\n"
"        After receiving your first donation, <t t-out=\"&#x27;the children&#x27; if plural else firstname\"></t> will be informed that <t t-out=\"children.get(&#x27;he&#x27;)\"></t> now <t t-out=\"has\"></t> a sponsor.\n"
"        <b>\n"
"            <t t-out=\"payment_attachment\"></t>\n"
"        </b>\n"
"        <t t-if=\"len(partner.sponsorship_ids) == len(sponsorships)\">\n"
"            Please <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/de/zahlungsart-deiner-patenschaft\">click here</a> if you have any questions about your donation.\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    In a series of short emails over the coming month, we will explain everything you need to know about <t t-out=\"firstname if less_3 else &#x27;the children&#x27;\"></t> and the sponsorship.\n"
"</p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"is_new\">\n"
"        Register and discover MyCompassion to write to your sponsored <t t-out=\"&#x27;children&#x27; if plural else &#x27;child&#x27;\"></t>, download photos and letters, find out more and adapt information linked to your <t t-out=\"&#x27;sponsorships&#x27; if plural else &#x27;sponsorship&#x27;\"></t> and much more.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        Just like for your other sponsorships, you will find all of <t t-out=\"firstname + apos if less_3 else &#x27;your sponsored children&#x27;\"></t> information and photos on MyCompassion and you can write to <t t-out=\"children.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"></t>.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<div style=\"margin:30px auto; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"    <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/de_DE/my/home\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"        MyCompassion\n"
"    </a>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<t t-if=\"is_new\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Thank you so much for making the decision to invest in the life of <t t-out=\"firstname if less_3 else &#x27;many children&#x27;\"></t>.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Warm regards\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><p>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dir\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"/>\n"
