"    <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, children.get_number(), translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"less_3\" t-value=\"firstname != children.get_number()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"&#x27;LSV&#x27; in payment_modes\">\n"
"        <t t-if=\"is_new\">\n"
"            <t t-set=\"payment_type_attachement\" t-value=\"&#x27;Im Anhang &#x27; + (&#x27;findet ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;findest du&#x27;) + &#x27; die Einzugsermächtigung für die Bank. Wir bitten &#x27; + (&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;) + &#x27;, diese auszufüllen und uns per Post zurückzusenden&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"            <t t-set=\"payment_type_attachement\" t-value=\"&#x27;Wir werden &#x27; + (&#x27;euer&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dein&#x27;) + &#x27; Konto mit &#x27; + (&#x27;den zusätzlichen Patenschaftsbeträgen&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dem zusätzlichen Patenschaftsbetrag&#x27;) + &#x27; belasten&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-elif=\"&#x27;BVR&#x27; in payment_modes\">\n"
"        <t t-if=\"period == 1\">\n"
"            <t t-set=\"payment_type_attachement\" t-value=\"&#x27;Im Anhang &#x27; + (&#x27;findet ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;findest du&#x27;) + &#x27; die Einzahlungsscheine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"            <t t-set=\"payment_type_attachement\" t-value=\"&#x27;Im Anhang &#x27; + (&#x27;findet ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;findest du&#x27;) + &#x27; den Einzahlungsschein&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        <t t-if=\"is_new\">\n"
"            <t t-set=\"payment_type_attachement\" t-value=\"&#x27;Im Anhang &#x27; + (&#x27;findet ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;findest du&#x27;) + &#x27; den Einzahlungsschein&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"            <t t-set=\"payment_type_attachement\" t-value=\"sponsorships.get_payment_type_attachment_string()\"/>\n"
"            <t t-if=\"payment_type_attachement.startswith(&quot;Ansonsten&quot;)\">\n"
"                <t t-set=\"payment_type_attachement\" t-value=\"sponsorships.get_payment_type_attachment_string().replace(&#x27;[findet]&#x27;, &#x27;findet ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;findest du&#x27;).replace(&#x27;[deine]&#x27;, deine).replace(&#x27;[dein]&#x27;, dein).replace(&#x27;[dich]&#x27;, dich).replace(&#x27;[Patenschaftsbetrag]&#x27;, &#x27;dem zusätzlichen Patenschaftsbetrag&#x27; if len(children) == 1 else &#x27;den zusätzlichen Patenschaftsbeträgen&#x27;).replace(&#x27;[du]&#x27;, du).replace(&#x27;[könnt]&#x27;, &quot;könnt, im Anhang&quot; if plural else &quot;kannst, im Anhang&quot;)\"/>\n"
"            </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"                <t t-set=\"payment_type_attachement\" t-value=\"sponsorships.get_payment_type_attachment_string().replace(&#x27;[findet]&#x27;, &#x27;findet ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;findest du&#x27;).replace(&#x27;[deine]&#x27;, deine).replace(&#x27;[dein]&#x27;, dein).replace(&#x27;[dich]&#x27;, dich).replace(&#x27;[Patenschaftsbetrag]&#x27;, &#x27;dem zusätzlichen Patenschaftsbetrag&#x27; if len(children) == 1 else &#x27;den zusätzlichen Patenschaftsbeträgen&#x27;).replace(&#x27;[du]&#x27;, du).replace(&#x27;[könnt]&#x27;, &quot;könnt&quot; if plural else &quot;kannst&quot;)\"/>\n"
"            </t>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children_in_poverty\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;children_in_poverty&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"early_deaths\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;early_deaths&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_mothers\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_mothers&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_unacceptable_conditions\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_unacceptable_conditions&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"is_new\">\n"
"        So schön, <t t-out=\"&#x27;ihr gehört&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du gehörst&#x27;\"></t> nun zur Compassion Familie!\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        Herzlichen Dank, dass <t t-out=\"du\"></t> <t t-out=\"dich\"></t> entschieden <t t-out=\"&#x27;habt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;hast&#x27;\"></t>, in das Leben <t t-out=\"&#x27;eines weiteren Kindes&#x27; if len(children) == 1 else &#x27;weiterer Kinder&#x27;\"></t> zu investieren.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Mit <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> zusammen befreien wir zurzeit mit rund <t t-out=\"number_fcps\"></t> Partnerkirchen in <t t-out=\"number_countries\"></t> Ländern <t t-out=\"number_children\"></t> Millionen Kinder aus extremer Armut. Gemeinsam ermöglichen wir den Kindern ein Leben mit Hoffnung und Zukunft.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"payer\">\n"
"        Nachdem <t t-out=\"deine\"></t> erste Patenschaftsspende bei uns eingetroffen ist, <t t-out=\"(children.get(&#x27;will be&#x27;) + &#x27; &#x27; + firstname) if less_3 else &#x27;werden die Kinder&#x27;\"></t> darüber informiert, dass <t t-out=\"children.get(&#x27;he&#x27;)\"></t> nun\n"
"\n"
"        <t t-if=\"plural\">\n"
"            Paten bekommen <t t-out=\"children.get(&#x27;has&#x27;)\"></t>.\n"
"        </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"            <t t-out=\"&#x27;eine Patin&#x27; if partner.gender == &#x27;F&#x27; else &#x27;einen Paten&#x27;\"></t> bekommen <t t-out=\"children.get(&#x27;has&#x27;)\"></t>.\n"
"        </t>\n"
"        <b><t t-out=\"payment_type_attachement\"></t><t t-out=\"&#x27;&#x27; if payment_type_attachement.endswith(&#x27;.&#x27;) else &#x27;.&#x27;\"></t></b>\n"
"        Falls <t t-out=\"du\"></t> Fragen zur Spende <t t-out=\"&#x27;habt, findet ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;hast, findest du&#x27;\"></t>\n"
"\n"
"        <t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"            <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/de/zahlungsart-deiner-patenschaft\">\n"
"                hier Informationen\n"
"            </a>\n"
"            dazu.\n"
"        </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"            hier Informationen dazu: www.compassion.ch/de/zahlungsart-deiner-patenschaft\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"is_new\">\n"
"        <t t-out=\"&#x27;Registriert&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Registriere&#x27;\"></t> <t t-out=\"dich\"></t> und <t t-out=\"&#x27;entdeckt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;entdecke&#x27;\"></t> <t t-out=\"&quot;MyCompassion&quot; if object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot; else &quot;www.mycompassion.ch&quot;\"></t>, um <t t-out=\"children.get(&#x27;eurem Patenkind&#x27;) if plural else children.get(&#x27;deinem Patenkind&#x27;)\"></t> zu schreiben, Briefe und Fotos herunterzuladen, Informationen über <t t-out=\"deine\"></t> <t t-out=\"children.get(&#x27;Patenschaft&#x27;)\"></t> anzusehen und anzupassen und vieles mehr.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        Wie bisher <t t-out=\"&quot;werdet ihr&quot; if plural else &quot;wirst du&quot;\"></t> alle Informationen zu <t t-out=\"deine\"></t>n Spenden in MyCompassion finden.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"    <div style=\"margin:30px auto; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"        <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/de_DE/my/home\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"            MyCompassion\n"
"        </a>\n"
"    </div>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-if=\"is_new\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Herzlichen Dank, dass <t t-out=\"du\"></t> <t t-out=\"dich\"></t> entschieden <t t-out=\"&#x27;habt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;hast&#x27;\"></t>, in das Leben von <t t-out=\"firstname if less_3 else firstname.split()[0] + &#x27; Kindern&#x27;\"></t> zu investieren.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Liebe Grüsse\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-if=\"object.send_mode != 'physical'\"><t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"/></t><t t-else=\"\"><t t-out=\"object.user_id.short_signature\"/></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.mail_onboarding_step1
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><p>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"one_child\" t-value=\"len(children) == 1\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine_patenkinder\" t-value=\"&#x27;your sponsored children&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, deine_patenkinder, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"less_4\" t-value=\"firstname != deine_patenkinder\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"wp\" t-value=\"&quot;SWP&quot; in sponsorships.mapped(&quot;type&quot;)\"/>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.informal_salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"sponsorships.filtered(&quot;is_first_sponsorship&quot;)\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        This is the first of five emails that you will receive from us.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Today we will help you get to know <t t-out=\"children.get_child_preposition_country(&#x27;from_preposition&#x27;, child_limit=3, country_limit=3, child_substitution=deine_patenkinder, country_substitution=deine_patenkinder)\"></t> better (PDF attached).\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Did you know that you can visit your sponsored <t t-out=\"&#x27;children&#x27; if not one_child else &#x27;child&#x27;\"></t>?\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <div style=\"margin:30px auto; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"        <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/de/reisen/\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"            More information on visits\n"
"        </a>\n"
"    </div>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Thank you for deciding to invest in the life of <t t-out=\"&#x27;more children&#x27; if not one_child else &#x27;another child&#x27;\"></t>!\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Warm regards\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"</div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine_patenkinder\" t-value=\"&#x27;deine Patenkinder&#x27; if not plural else &#x27;eure Patenkinder&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, deine_patenkinder, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"less_4\" t-value=\"firstname != deine_patenkinder\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dir\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dich\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dein\" t-value=\"&#x27;euer&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dein&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"wp\" t-value=\"&quot;SWP&quot; in sponsorships.mapped(&quot;type&quot;)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.informal_salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"sponsorships.filtered(&quot;is_first_sponsorship&quot;)\">\n"
"        Dies ist die erste der von uns angekündigten fünf E-Mails.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Heute stellen wir <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> <t t-out=\"children.get_child_preposition_country(child_limit=3, country_limit=3, child_substitution=deine_patenkinder, country_substitution=deine_patenkinder)\"></t> besser vor (PDF<t t-out=\"&#x27;&#x27; if len(children) == 1 else &#x27;s&#x27;\"></t> im Anhang).\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"sponsorships.filtered(&quot;is_first_sponsorship&quot;) and not wp\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Gerne laden wir <t t-out=\"dich\"></t> zur Videokonferenz für unsere neuen Patinnen und Paten ein. Während einer Stunde <t t-out=\"&#x27;erfahrt ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;erfährst du&#x27;\"></t>,  was <t t-out=\"deine\"></t> <t t-out=\"children.get(&#x27;Patenschaft&#x27;)\"></t> <t t-out=\"&#x27;bewirkt&#x27; if len(children) == 1 else &#x27;bewirken&#x27;\"></t> und wie sie <t t-out=\"&#x27;funktioniert&#x27; if len(children) == 1 else &#x27;funktionieren&#x27;\"></t>. Zudem <t t-out=\"&#x27;könnt ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;kannst du&#x27;\"></t> alle <t t-out=\"deine\"></t> Fragen stellen.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Wir freuen uns, <t t-out=\"dich\"></t> kennenzulernen!\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <div style=\"margin:30px auto; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"        <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/de_DE/zoom/register\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"            Nächster Videokonferenztermin\n"
"        </a>\n"
"    </div>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"&#x27;Habt ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Hast du&#x27;\"></t> gewusst, dass <t t-out=\"du\"></t> <t t-out=\"children.get(&#x27;euer Patenkind&#x27;) if plural else children.get(&#x27;dein Patenkind&#x27;)\"></t> besuchen <t t-out=\"&#x27;könnt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;kannst&#x27;\"></t>?\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div style=\"margin:30px auto; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"    <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/de/reisen/\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"        Informationen zu den Besuchen\n"
"    </a>\n"
"</div>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"not sponsorships.filtered(&quot;is_first_sponsorship&quot;)\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Herzlichen Dank, dass <t t-out=\"du\"></t> <t t-out=\"dich\"></t> entschieden <t t-out=\"&#x27;habt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;hast&#x27;\"></t>, in das Leben <t t-out=\"&#x27;eines weiteren Kindes&#x27; if len(children) == 1 else &#x27;weiterer Kinder&#x27;\"></t> zu investieren!\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Liebe Grüsse\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"</div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.email_sponsorship_no_sub
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><p>\n"
"   <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   We understand and acknowledge  you have decided not to take over a new sponsorship at this time.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Thank you for your past investment in the life of a child living in poverty.  More than 70 years of experience assures us that this commitment produces sustainable results. <t t-out=\"object.success_sentence or &#x27;&#x27;\"></t>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   If you have set up an automatic payment order for your sponsorship, please cancel it.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Did you know that you can also help children in poverty by giving them access to drinking water (water filters, toilet installations, hygiene awareness)? With a one-time gift or regular donations of CHF 10, 20 or 30 per month - you can make a big difference.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   If you are interested, please call us at 031 552 21 25 or you can also donate online on www.compassion.ch/spenden\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Thank you again for your generosity so far.\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Best regards,\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"     <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"</t>\n"
"  </p>\n"
" </div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects().mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dir\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dich\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dein\" t-value=\"&#x27;euer&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dein&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"name\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Hiermit bestätigen wir <t t-out=\"deine\"></t> Entscheidung, <t t-out=\"name\"></t>, <t t-out=\"&quot;deren&quot; if child[:1].gender == &quot;F&quot; else &quot;dessen&quot;\"></t> Informationen wir <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> kürzlich hatten zukommen lassen, nicht zu unterstützen.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Herzlichen Dank für <t t-out=\"dein\"></t> Engagement für Kinder in extremer Armut. Wir sind uns sicher, dass <t t-out=\"deine\"></t> bisherige Unterstützung einen wesentlichen Unterschied gemacht hat.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Kinderpatenschaften sind nur ein Programmteil von Compassion. <t t-out=\"&quot;Habt ihr&quot; if plural else &quot;Hast du&quot;\"></t> gewusst, dass <t t-out=\"du\"></t> Babys und Müttern im Überlebensprogramm unterstützen <t t-out=\"&quot;könnt&quot; if plural else &quot;kannst&quot;\"></t>? Mit einer einmaligen oder regelmässigen Spende <t t-out=\"&#x27;könnt ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;kannst du&#x27;\"></t> einen grossen Unterschied bewirken: Medizinische Betreuung während der Schwangerschaft, Entbindung in einer medizinischen Einrichtung, Beratung zum Thema Elternwerden, psychische, soziale und geistliche Betreuung, materielle Unterstützung sowie Ausbildung für Einkommenssicherung. Mit CHF 15.- unterstützt <t t-out=\"du\"></t> eine Frau und ihr Baby während einer ganzen Woche. Gerne <t t-out=\"&#x27;könnt ihr euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;kannst du dich&#x27;\"></t> bei uns melden oder hier spenden:\n"
"    <t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"        <a t-attf-href=\"https://compassion.ch/de/ueberleben/\">Überlebensprogramm.</a>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        www.compassion.ch/de/ueberleben.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Liebe Grüsse\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.sms_confirmation_email_1
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"sponsorship\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorship.child_id\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"image_url\" t-value=\"child.image_url.replace(&#x27;media.ci.org/&#x27;, &#x27;media.ci.org/g_face,c_thumb,w_150,h_150,r_max/&#x27;) if child.image_url else None\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"confirmation_url\" t-value=\"&quot;/child/&quot; + str(child.id) + &quot;/sponsor/confirmation?face_reveal=1&quot;\"/>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"<t t-if=\"image_url\">\n"
"<div style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;text-align:center;&gt;&#10;&lt;img src=\">\n"
"</div>\n"
"</t>\n"
"                <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"                  Hello!\n"
"                  </p>\n"
"                  <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"                   It's so wonderful that you wish to invest in the life of <t t-out=\"child.preferred_name\"></t>. You will change <t t-out=\"child.get(&quot;his&quot;)\"></t> life in a sustainable way.\n"
"                    <br/><br/>\n"
"                    <a t-attf-href=\"{{confirmation_url}}\" style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#0055A6;text-decoration: underline;\">Click here</a> to complete your details.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"                    Best regards,\n"
"<br/><br/>\n"
" <t t-out=\"object.user_id.preferred_name\"></t> <t t-out=\"object.user_id.lastname\"></t>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <t t-out=\"object.user_id.employee_ids.department_id.name\"></t>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <t t-out=\"object.user_id.company_id.address_name\"></t>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"            </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorship\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorship.child_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"image_url\" t-value=\"child.image_url.replace(&#x27;media.ci.org/&#x27;, &#x27;media.ci.org/g_face,c_thumb,w_150,h_150,r_max/&#x27;) if child.image_url else None\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"confirmation_url\" t-value=\"&quot;/child/&quot; + str(child.id) + &quot;/sponsor/confirmation?face_reveal=1&quot;\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<t t-if=\"image_url\">\n"
"    <div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n"
"        <img t-attf-src=\"{{image_url}}\" title=\"\"/>\n"
"    </div>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Hallo!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <b>\n"
"        So schön, dass du in das Leben von <t t-out=\"child.preferred_name\"></t> investieren willst. Du wirst dazu beitragen, <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;sein&#x27;)\"></t> Leben nachhaltig zu verändern.\n"
"    </b>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <a t-attf-href=\"{{confirmation_url}}\">Klicke hier</a>, um deine Angaben zu ergänzen.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Bitte beachte deine E-Mails, da wir dir über diesen Kanal alle nötigen Informationen zur Patenschaft schicken werden.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Gemeinsam verändern wir das Leben von Kindern - eins nach dem anderen.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Liebe Grüsse vom Compassion Team\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

