#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.csp_mail_template
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"   <t t-set=\"contracts\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"   <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Thank you to support a child survival program from Compassion.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   From pregnancy through infanthood, Child Survival offers help that moms and babies desperately need to survive and thrive. More than 64,598 moms and babies have been helped to date! Through our Child Survival Centers, we ensure mothers and babies receive any of the following:\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"  </p>\n"
"  <ul style=\"margin:0px 0 1rem 0;\">\n"
"   <li>\n"
"    Basic Nutrition in the form of clean water, healthy food and vitamins.\n"
"   </li>\n"
"   <li>\n"
"    Pre-natal and post-natal medical exams to monitor mom and baby’s health.\n"
"   </li>\n"
"   <li>\n"
"    Critical medical resources such as child birth assistance.\n"
"   </li>\n"
"   <li>\n"
"    Monthly growth monitoring to protect the children from malnutrition.\n"
"   </li>\n"
"   <li>\n"
"    Immunizations and other medical care for newborns and babies.\n"
"   </li>\n"
"   <li>\n"
"    Mentoring from a survival specialist that gives one-on-one coaching and support.\n"
"   </li>\n"
"   <li>\n"
"    Opportunities for infants to learn cognitive skills.\n"
"   </li>\n"
"   <li>\n"
"    Workshops that teach mothers parenting and survival skills.\n"
"   </li>\n"
"   <li>\n"
"    Home visits to check in on mother and baby.\n"
"   </li>\n"
"   <li>\n"
"    Emotional support from a community of moms facing the same fears.\n"
"   </li>\n"
"  </ul>\n"
"  Each Child Survival Center is staffed with warm, caring, knowledgeable individuals that serve mothers and babies extremely well. Your donations give children under 1 year old a head start toward a healthy life!\n"
"  <br/>\n"
"  <br/>\n"
"  There is no correspondence with the mothers, nevertheless you will receive a newsletter with information about the program and testimonies from mothers.\n"
"  <br/>\n"
"  <br/>\n"
"  Please do not hesitate to contact us if you have any questions.\n"
"  <br/>\n"
"  <br/>\n"
"  Sincerely\n"
" </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"new_contracts\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"contracts\" t-value=\"partner.other_contract_ids\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"partner.sponsorship_ids.filtered(&#x27;is_active&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29 or not partner.title\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dein\" t-value=\"&#x27;euer&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dein&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dir\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dich\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"christmas_fund_2022\" t-value=\"265 in partner.category_id.ids\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Herzlichen Dank, dass <t t-out=\"du\"></t> das Überlebensprogramm für Mütter und Babys unterstützt.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Das Überlebensprogramm von Compassion richtet sich an Mütter und deren Babys, die in extremer Armut leben. Es unterstützt sie in ihren gesundheitlichen, wirtschaftlichen und sozialen Bedürfnissen vor und nach einer Geburt. Neue Studien zeigen, dass gerade das erste Jahr entscheidend für den weiteren Verlauf im Leben eines Kindes ist. <t t-out=\"deine.capitalize()\"></t> Spende macht einen riesigen Unterschied im Leben dieser Mütter und Babys.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Dank <t t-out=\"deine\"></t>r Unterstützung erhalten Babys und Mütter im Überlebensprogramm:\n"
"</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"    <li>Wichtige Vitamine und Nahrung</li>\n"
"    <li>Pränatale und postnatale medizinische Untersuchungen</li>\n"
"    <li>Monatliche Untersuchungen, um die Kinder vor Unterernährung zu schützen</li>\n"
"    <li>Impfungen und medizinische Versorgung für Neugeborene bis zum ersten Lebensjahr</li>\n"
"    <li>Geistliche Begleitung und Mentoring für Schwangere und Mütter</li>\n"
"    <li>Kognitive Unterstützung für Babys</li>\n"
"    <li>Workshops zum Thema Erziehung</li>\n"
"    <li>Ermutigung von anderen Müttern</li>\n"
"    <li>Besuche zu Hause</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Regelmässig <t t-out=\"&#x27;werdet ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;wirst du&#x27;\"></t> Neuigkeiten und Erfahrungsberichte von Müttern und Babys, die von Compassion unterstützt werden, erhalten.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Danke, dass <t t-out=\"du\"></t> mit <t t-out=\"deine\"></t>r Spende ermöglich<t t-out=\"&#x27;t&#x27; if plural else &#x27;st&#x27;\"></t>, vielen weiteren Müttern und ihren Kindern Hoffnung und Hilfe zu schenken.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Wir werden die Spenden nicht mehr einzeln verdanken, sondern <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> anfangs nächstes Jahr eine Spendenbestätigung schicken.\n"
"    <t t-if=\"sponsorships\">\n"
"        <t t-out=\"du.capitalize()\"></t> <t t-out=\"&#x27;könnt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;kannst&#x27;\"></t> die Übersicht <t t-out=\"deine\"></t>r Spenden auch jederzeit in <a href=\"http://www.mycompassion.ch\">MyCompassion</a> einsehen.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Für Fragen stehen wir <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> gerne zur Verfügung.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Liebe Grüsse\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.email_sponsorship_anniversary_5
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"   <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), False)\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"Congratulations! It’s been 5 years since you’ve been supporting <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>! On behalf of the entire team at Compassion Switzerland, we would like to thank you for your commitment to a child in extreme poverty.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Your sponsorship has a great impact on the development of this child. It enables <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"></t> to live a life without extreme poverty but with dignity and real hope. <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> is one of 2,3 million children currently supported by Compassion’s sponsorship program. Thank you for working together with us.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Yours sincerely.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"  </p>\n"
" <t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"one_child\" t-value=\"len(child) == 1\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dein\" t-value=\"&#x27;euer&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dein&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, deine + &quot; Patenkinder&quot;, False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Herzlichen Glückwunsch!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Seit 5 Jahren unterstützt <t t-out=\"du\"></t> <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> und <t t-out=\"&#x27;helft&#x27; if plural else &#x27;hilfst&#x27;\"></t> mit, <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;ihn&#x27;)\"></t> aus extremer Armut zu befreien.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Durch die Patenschaft für <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> <t t-out=\"&#x27;schenkt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;schenkst&#x27;\"></t> <t t-out=\"du\"></t> <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;ihm&#x27;)\"></t> aber auch Mut, eigene Träume zu haben und diese zu verfolgen.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Danke für <t t-out=\"deine\"></t> wertvolle Treue.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"len(child) == 1\">\n"
"        <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;is&#x27;)\"></t> eines\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        <t t-out=\"deine.title()\"></t> Patenkinder sind Teil\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    von den zurzeit mehr als <t t-out=\"number_children\"></t> Millionen Kindern, <t t-out=\"&quot;welches&quot; if len(child) == 1 else &quot;welche&quot;\"></t> durch eine Patin oder einen Paten von Compassion unterstützt <t t-out=\"&#x27;wird&#x27; if one_child else &#x27;werden&#x27;\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Gemeinsam verändern wir das Leben von Kindern - eins nach dem anderen.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Liebe Grüsse\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.compassion_reset_password_email
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"<t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"link\" t-value=\"str(partner.signup_url).replace(&#x27;erp.compassion&#x27;, &#x27;mycompassion&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0 1rem 0;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    Dear <t t-out=\"partner.preferred_name\"></t>,\n"
"<br/>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"    You have requested a new password for your Compassion Account. You may change your password by following this link which will remain valid during 24 hours:\n"
"   </p>\n"
"   <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;color: rgb(119, 119, 119); text-align: center; margin-top: 16px;\">\n"
"    <a t-attf-href=\"{{link}}\" style=\"text-decoration:none;background-color:transparent;color:rgb(124, 123, 173);padding: 5px 10px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#875A7B; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #875A7B; border: 1px solid #875A7B; border-radius:3px\">\n"
"     Change password\n"
"    </a>\n"
"   </div>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"   <p style=\"margin:0px 0 1rem 0;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    If you do not expect this, you can safely ignore this email.\n"
"<br/>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"     Thank you for your committed effort in the fight against extreme poverty. Please feel free to contact us if you have any questions.\n"
"     <br/>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"    Best Regards,\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"    Compassion Switzerland\n"
"   </p>\n"
" </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dein\" t-value=\"&#x27;euer&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dein&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dir\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dich\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"link\" t-value=\"str(partner.signup_url).replace(&#x27;erp.compassion&#x27;, &#x27;mycompassion&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"&quot;Ihr habt&quot; if plural else &quot;Du hast&quot;\"></t> nach einem neuen Passwort für <t t-out=\"dein\"></t> Profil gefragt.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Über den Link unten <t t-out=\"&quot;könnt ihr&quot; if plural else &quot;kannst du&quot;\"></t> <t t-out=\"dein\"></t> Passwort ändern (der Link ist nur für 24\n"
"    Stunden gültig).\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 16px; text-transform: uppercase\">\n"
"    <a t-attf-href=\"{{link}}\" style=\"padding: 5px 10px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\">\n"
"        Passwort ändern\n"
"    </a>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Herzlichen Dank für <t t-out=\"deine\"></t>n Einsatz gegen extreme Armut. <t t-out=\"&quot;Meldet euch&quot; if plural else &quot;Melde dich&quot;\"></t> jederzeit bei uns, wenn <t t-out=\"du\"></t> Fragen <t t-out=\"&quot;habt&quot; if plural else &quot;hast&quot;\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Liebe Grüsse vom Compassion  Team\n"
"</p>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.auto_reminder_archive_partners_template
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"                    <b>The following partners meet the criteria (see <a href=\"/web#action=521&amp;active_id=895&amp;cids=1&amp;id=600&amp;menu_id=2029&amp;model=project.task&amp;view_type=form\">T0024</a>) and are considered invalid : </b>\n"
"                    <span style=\"font-family: 'miller';\">\n"
"                    <t t-foreach=\"ctx.get(&#x27;partners_to_archive&#x27;)\" t-as=\"partner\">\n"
"                        <p><a t-attf-href=\"/web#id={{partner.id}}&amp;model=res.partner&amp;view_type=form\">Ref <t t-out=\"partner.ref\"></t> - <t t-out=\"partner.name\"></t></a></p>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    </span>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"            </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"                    <b>The following partners meet the criteria (see <a href=\"/web#action=521&amp;active_id=895&amp;cids=1&amp;id=600&amp;menu_id=2029&amp;model=project.task&amp;view_type=form\">T0024</a>) and are considered invalid : </b>\n"
"                    <span style=\"font-family: 'miller';\">\n"
"                    <t t-foreach=\"ctx.get('partners_to_archive')\" t-as=\"partner\">\n"
"                        <p><a t-attf-href=\"/web#id={{partner.id}}&amp;model=res.partner&amp;view_type=form\">Ref <t t-out=\"partner.ref\"/> - <t t-out=\"partner.name\"/></a></p>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    </span>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"            </body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.old_letter
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"letter\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    letter: <t t-out=\"letter\"></t><br/><br/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"cetteLettre\" t-value=\"&#x27;cette lettre&#x27; if len(letter) == 1 else &#x27;ces lettres&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    cetteLettre: <t t-out=\"cetteLettre\"></t>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"uneLettre\" t-value=\"&#x27;une lettre&#x27; if len(letter) == 1 else &#x27;des lettres&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"letter.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner_name\" t-value=\"partner.firstname and (partner.firstname + &#x27; &#x27; + partner.lastname) or partner.name\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"urls\" t-value=\"[]\"/>\n"
"    <t t-foreach=\"letter.filtered(&#x27;read_url&#x27;).mapped(&#x27;read_url&#x27;)\" t-as=\"l\">\n"
"        <t t-if=\"l not in urls\">\n"
"            <t t-set=\"void\" t-value=\"urls.append(l)\"/>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"wp_tchat_url\" t-value=\"&quot;https://mycompassion.ch/fr_CH/im_livechat/support/3&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;sms&quot;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"partner.informal_salutation\"></t>,\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Nous sommes heureux de t'envoyer la nouvelle lettre de <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, translate=False)\"></t>!\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Clique ici pour télécharger la lettre: <a t-attf-href=\"{{urls[0]}}\">Lettre</a>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Bonne lecture!\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Si tu as cinq minutes, pourrais-tu directement répondre à cette lettre? Clique simplement ici: <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/fr_CH/my/letter\">MyCompassion</a>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Merci et à bientôt!\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        L'équipe de Compassion\n"
"        <br/>Tel: +41 (0)24 434 21 24\n"
"        <br/>Des questions? Écris-nous sur WhatsApp: +41 (0)79 622 31 97\n"
"    </p>\n"
"% else:  \n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        C'est avec joie que nous vous adressons <t t-out=\"uneLettre\"></t> de <t t-out=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), False)\"></t> ! Comme vous le constaterez, <t t-out=\"&quot;cette lettre n&#x27;est&quot; if len(letter) == 1 else &quot;ces lettres ne sont&quot;\"></t> pas toute récente<t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;accord_s&#x27;)\"></t>, la faute à un problème technique survenu lors de la transmission. Toutes nos excuses pour ce désagrément.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"            Cliquez sur le lien pour télécharger <t t-out=\"cetteLettre\"></t>*. Nous vous souhaitons beaucoup de plaisir à la lecture des nouvelles de <t t-out=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), False)\"></t>\n"
"            </p>\n"
"            <ul>\n"
"                <t t-foreach=\"urls\" t-as=\"l\">\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        <a t-attf-href=\"{{l}}\">\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"l\"></t>\n"
"                        </a>\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                </t>\n"
"                </ul>\n"
"            <p>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"years_uc\"></t> <t t-out=\"number_years\"></t> ans d'expérience montrent que ces lettres peuvent contribuer de façon déterminante au développement de l'enfant.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        D'avance, merci de prendre quelques minutes pour répondre <t t-out=\"&#x27;au courrier ci-joint&#x27; if len(child) == 1 else &#x27;aux courriers ci-joints&#x27;\"></t>, avec quelques paroles d'encouragement à <t t-out=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), False)\"></t>. Vous pouvez lui écrire\n"
"        <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch\">en ligne</a>.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        N'hésitez pas à prendre contact avec nous pour toute question relative aux échanges de courriers !\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Merci de transformer la vie <t t-out=\"&#x27;d&#x27;un enfant&#x27; if len(child) == 1 else &#x27;de plusieurs enfants et de les&#x27;\"></t> et de le libérer de l'extrême pauvreté pour une vie digne et qui ait du sens.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Avec nos chaleureuses salutations.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"            </p>\n"
"            <p>\n"
"                <t t-out=\"object.sudo().user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        *En cas de problème pour ouvrir une ou plusieurs lettres, vous pouvez aussi les télécharger depuis votre compte MyCompassion.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"% endif</body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"letter\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"letter.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"denBrief\" t-value=\"&#x27;den Brief&#x27; if len(letter) == 1 else &#x27;die Briefe&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"leLien\" t-value=\"&#x27;den Link&#x27; if len(letter) == 1 else &#x27;die Links&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dein\" t-value=\"&#x27;euer&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dein&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, deine + &#x27;n Patenkindern&#x27;, False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"urls\" t-value=\"[]\"/>\n"
"    <t t-foreach=\"letter.filtered(&#x27;read_url&#x27;).mapped(&#x27;read_url&#x27;)\" t-as=\"l\">\n"
"        <t t-if=\"l not in urls\">\n"
"            <t t-set=\"void\" t-value=\"urls.append(l)\"/>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"wp_tchat_url\" t-value=\"&quot;https://mycompassion.ch/de_DE/im_livechat/support/2&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.informal_salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;sms&quot;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Wir freuen uns, <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> einen neuen Brief von <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> zu senden!\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"&#x27;Klickt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Klicke&#x27;\"></t> hier, um den Brief herunterzuladen: <a t-attf-href=\"{{urls[0]}}\">link</a>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Viel Spass beim Lesen!\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"&#x27;Nehmt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Nimm&#x27;\"></t> <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> doch fünf Minuten Zeit, um auf den Brief zu antworten über\n"
"        MyCompassion: <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/de_DE/my/letter\">MyCompassion</a>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Liebe Grüsse<br/>\n"
"        Sarah<br/>\n"
"        Tel: +41 (0)31 552 21 21<br/>\n"
"        Fragen? Melde dich per WhatsApp bei uns: +41 (0)79 622 31 97\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Wir freuen uns, <t t-out=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"></t> <t t-out=\"&quot;einen neuen Brief&quot; if len(letter) == 1 else &quot;neue Briefe&quot;\"></t>\n"
"        von <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> zu senden!\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Leider gab es ein technisches Problem beim Versand. Deswegen <t t-out=\"&quot;ist der Brief&quot; if len(letter) == 1 else &quot;sind\n"
"        die Briefe&quot;\"></t> nicht ganz aktuell. Das tut uns leid!\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27;\">\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            <t t-out=\"&#x27;Klickt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Klicke&#x27;\"></t> auf <t t-out=\"leLien\"></t>, um <t t-out=\"denBrief\"></t> herunterzuladen.* Viel Spass beim Lesen:\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <ul>\n"
"            <t t-foreach=\"urls\" t-as=\"l\">\n"
"                <li>\n"
"                    <a t-attf-href=\"{{l}}\">\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"l\"></t>\n"
"                    </a>\n"
"                </li>\n"
"            </t>\n"
"        </ul>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"years_uc\"></t> <t t-out=\"number_years\"></t> Jahren Erfahrung zeigen uns, dass Briefe die Entwicklung des Kindes entscheidend\n"
"        beeinflussen können.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"&#x27;Nehmt euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Nimm dir&#x27;\"></t> doch fünf Minuten Zeit, um auf <t t-out=\"denBrief\"></t> zu antworten.\n"
"\n"
"        <t t-if=\"object.send_mode != &quot;physical&quot;\">\n"
"            <t t-out=\"&quot;Ihr könnt&quot; if plural else &quot;Du kannst&quot;\"></t> schnell und einfach über <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/de_DE\">MyCompassion</a> schreiben.\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"&#x27;Habt ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Hast du&#x27;\"></t> Fragen zur Korrespondenz mit <t t-out=\"child.get(&quot;eurem Patenkind&quot;) if plural else child.get(&quot;deinem Patenkind&quot;)\"></t>? Dann <t t-out=\"&#x27;meldet euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;melde dich&#x27;\"></t> ungeniert bei uns.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Liebe Grüsse\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            <t t-out=\"object.sudo().user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"        </p>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        *Falls <t t-out=\"du\"></t> Probleme beim Öffnen des Briefes <t t-out=\"&#x27;habt, könnt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;hast, kannst&#x27;\"></t> <t t-out=\"du\"></t> den Brief\n"
"        auf MyCompassion herunterladen.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"% endif</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.email_new_labels
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects().mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, &#x27;your sponsored children&#x27;, False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"len(child) == 1\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"anewsheet\" t-value=\"&#x27;a new sheet&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"&#x27;child&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"anewsheet\" t-value=\"&#x27;the new sheets&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"&#x27;children&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Thank you for investing into the life of <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Please find enclosed <t t-out=\"anewsheet\"></t> of labels for the letters you wish to send by post.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Do you know that you can write your letters easily in your <a href=\"https://www.mycompassion.ch\">MyCompassion profile</a>? With it, you always have the pictures, letters and information of your <t t-out=\"child\"></t> at hand.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Enjoy writing!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Kind regards,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.short_signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dir\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dich\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dein\" t-value=\"&#x27;euer&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dein&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"Deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;Eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects().mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Danke, dass <t t-out=\"du\"></t> in das Leben von <t t-out=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, deine + &#x27;n Patenkindern&#x27;, False)\"></t> <t t-out=\"&#x27;investiert&#x27; if plural else &#x27;investierst&#x27;\"></t>.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Beiliegend schicken wir <t t-out=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"></t> <t t-out=\"&quot;ein neues Etikettenblatt&quot; if len(child) == 1 else &quot;neue Etiketten&quot;\"></t> für die Briefe, welche <t t-out=\"du\"></t> per Post <t t-out=\"&#x27;schreibt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;schreibst&#x27;\"></t>.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Bitte <t t-out=\"&#x27;klebt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;klebe&#x27;\"></t> jeweils auf alle Karten, Briefe, Aufkleber, Zeichnungen usw.\n"
"        eine Etikette. <t t-out=\"Deine\"></t> Briefpost <t t-out=\"&#x27;könnt ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;kannst du&#x27;\"></t> uns an die unten stehende\n"
"         Adresse schicken und wir werden sie für <t t-out=\"dich\"></t> weiterleiten.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"&quot;Habt ihr&quot; if plural else &quot;Hast du&quot;\"></t> gewusst, dass <t t-out=\"du\"></t> <t t-out=\"child.get(&quot;eurem Patenkind&quot;) if plural else child.get(&quot;deinem Patenkind&quot;)\"></t> schnell und einfach über www.mycompassion.ch schreiben <t t-out=\"&quot;könnt&quot; if plural else &quot;kannst&quot;\"></t>? Dort <t t-out=\"&quot;habt ihr&quot; if plural else &quot;hast du&quot;\"></t> die Bilder, Briefe und Informationen <t t-out=\"child.get(&quot;eures Patenkindes&quot; if plural else &quot;deines Patenkindes&quot;)\"></t> immer zur Hand.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Falls <t t-out=\"du\"></t> weitere Fragen <t t-out=\"&#x27;habt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;hast&#x27;\"></t>, sind wir gerne für <t t-out=\"dich\"></t> da.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Wir wünschen <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> viel Freude beim Schreiben!\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Liebe Grüsse\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27;\">\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"        </p>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</div>\n"
"\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.mail_onboarding_sponsorship_confirmation_not_read
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects().mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    We recently sent you an email to <t t-out=\"partner.email\"></t>, which doesn't seem to have reached you. Could you please let us know if you have a different email address. If our email went to the spam folder, could you please add compassion@compassion.ch to your address book? This way you will receive all the important information about <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;your sponsored child&#x27;)\"></t> in the future.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Below is the communication we sent you:\n"
"</p>\n"
"<span>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.env.ref(&#x27;partner_communication_switzerland.mail_onboarding_sponsorship_confirmation&#x27;).generate_email(object.id, [&#x27;body_html&#x27;])[&#x27;body_html&#x27;].replace(partner.salutation, &#x27;&#x27;).strip().replace(&#x27;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#x27;, &#x27;&#x27;)\"></t>\n"
"</span>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dir\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dich\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dein\" t-value=\"&#x27;euer&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dein&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Vor kurzem haben wir <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> eine E-Mail an <t t-out=\"partner.email\"></t> geschickt, die <t t-out=\"dich\"></t> nicht erreicht zu haben scheint. Bitte <t t-out=\"&quot;gebt&quot; if plural else &quot;gib&quot;\"></t> uns Bescheid, falls <t t-out=\"du\"></t> eine andere E-Mail-Adresse <t t-out=\"&quot;habt&quot; if plural else &quot;hast&quot;\"></t>. Falls unsere E-Mail im Spam Ordner gelandet ist, <t t-out=\"&quot;könnt ihr&quot; if plural else &quot;kannst du&quot;\"></t> compassion@compassion.ch zu <t t-out=\"deine\"></t>m Adressbuch hinzufügen. Dadurch <t t-out=\"&quot;werdet ihr&quot; if plural else &quot;wirst du&quot;\"></t> in Zukunft alle wichtigen Informationen zu <t t-out=\"deine + &#x27;m Patenkind&#x27; if len(child) == 1 else deine + &#x27;n Patenkindern&#x27;\"></t> erhalten.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Warum wir <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> geschrieben haben:\n"
"</p>\n"
"<span>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.env.ref(&#x27;partner_communication_switzerland.mail_onboarding_sponsorship_confirmation&#x27;).generate_email(object.id, [&#x27;body_html&#x27;])[&#x27;body_html&#x27;].replace(partner.salutation, &#x27;&#x27;).strip().replace(&#x27;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#x27;, &#x27;&#x27;)\"></t>\n"
"</span>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.email_wrpr_reminder
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"object.get_objects().mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29 or not partner.title.id\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    A few months ago, you decided to support <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> through our “Write &amp; Pray” sponsorship.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    The special feature of a “Write &amp; Pray” sponsorship is teamwork.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    You are known to <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> as <t t-out=\"children.get(&#x27;his&#x27;)\"></t> <t t-out=\"&#x27;sponsors&#x27; if plural else &#x27;sponsor&#x27;\"></t>. Another donor regularly provides the financial support for this type of sponsorship.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    We are counting on you to pray for <t t-out=\"children.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"></t> and write to <t t-out=\"children.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"></t> at least twice a year.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    So far, our records indicate that <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> <t t-out=\"&#x27;has&#x27; if len(children) == 1 else &#x27;have&#x27;\"></t> not received a letter from you.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Thank you for taking a few minutes of your time to write a letter to <t t-out=\"children.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"></t>, online via <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/my/letter\">MyCompassion</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Kind regards,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"</p></body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"object.get_objects().mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29 or not partner.title.id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"Du\" t-value=\"&#x27;Ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dein\" t-value=\"&#x27;euer&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dein&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dich\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dir\" t-value=\"&quot;euch&quot; if plural else &quot;dir&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"hast\" t-value=\"&quot;habt&quot; if plural else &quot;hast&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"kannst\" t-value=\"&quot;könnt&quot; if plural else &quot;kannst&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"bist\" t-value=\"&quot;seid&quot; if plural else &quot;bist&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"betest\" t-value=\"&quot;betet&quot; if plural else &quot;betest&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"schreibst\" t-value=\"&quot;schreibt&quot; if plural else &quot;schreibst&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"steht\" t-value=\"&quot;stehen&quot; if plural else &quot;steht&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dieses_Kindes\" t-value=\"&#x27;dieses Kindes&#x27; if len(children) == 1 else &#x27;dieser Kinder&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"Nimm\" t-value=\"&#x27;Nehmt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Nimm&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"plural\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"der_Pate\" t-value=\"&#x27;die Paten&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"der\" t-value=\"&#x27;die&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-elif=\"partner.gender == &#x27;M&#x27;\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"der_Pate\" t-value=\"&#x27;der Pate&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"der\" t-value=\"&#x27;der&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"der_Pate\" t-value=\"&#x27;die Patin&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"der\" t-value=\"&#x27;die&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"wp_tchat_url\" t-value=\"&quot;https://mycompassion.ch/de_DE/im_livechat/support/2&quot;\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Danke, dass <t t-out=\"du\"></t> <t t-out=\"dich\"></t> vor ein paar Monaten für eine \"Write &amp; Pray\" Patenschaft für <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> entschieden <t t-out=\"hast\"></t>!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Das Besondere an einer \"Write &amp; Pray\" Patenschaft ist die Teamarbeit.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"Du\"></t> <t t-out=\"bist\"></t> <t t-out=\"der_Pate\"></t>, <t t-out=\"der\"></t> mit <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> in Kontakt <t t-out=\"steht\"></t>. Ein anderer Spender oder eine andere Spenderin sorgt für die finanzielle Unterstützung <t t-out=\"dieses_Kindes\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Wir zählen auf <t t-out=\"dich\"></t>, dass <t t-out=\"du\"></t> für <t t-out=\"children.get(&#x27;ihn&#x27;)\"></t> <t t-out=\"betest\"></t> und <t t-out=\"children.get(&#x27;ihm&#x27;)\"></t> mindestens zweimal pro Jahr <t t-out=\"schreibst\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Bisher hat <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> noch keinen Brief von <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> bekommen.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"Nimm\"></t> <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> doch fünf Minuten Zeit, um einen Brief zu schreiben. <t t-out=\"Du\"></t> <t t-out=\"kannst\"></t> schnell und einfach über <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/my/letter\">MyCompassion</a> schreiben.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Liebe Grüsse</p>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;sms&quot;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Sarah<br/>\n"
"Tel: +41 (0)31 552 21 21<br/>\n"
"Fragen? Melde dich per WhatsApp bei uns: +41 (0)79 622 31 97 \n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"</t></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.tax_receipt_letter_template
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tax_year\" t-value=\"2025\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"major_donor\" t-value=\"18454 in partner.category_id.ids\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"not major_donor\">\n"
"        <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"      </p><div style=\"height: 15mm\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    In <t t-out=\"tax_year\"></t>, we accomplished a lot together:\n"
"</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"    <li>Another 4,066 children were supported from Switzerland</li>\n"
"    <li>1,759 mothers and their babies received vital aid</li>\n"
"    <li>100 vocational training places were funded for young people</li>\n"
"    <li>34,775 children were given a Christmas gift</li>\n"
"    <li>4,886 families received food supplies</li>\n"
"    <li>3,765 children now have access to safe, clean toilets</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<p t-attf-style=\"{{'margin-bottom: 40px' if object.send_mode == 'digital' else ''}}\">\n"
"Thanks in part to your generosity and faithfulness, thank you from the bottom of our hearts!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<h4>Your <t t-out=\"tax_year\"></t> Donation Receipt</h4>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    We’re delighted to send you the tax receipt for the donations you made to Compassion in <t t-out=\"tax_year\"></t>. You can deduct 100% of your donations on your tax return in all Swiss cantons.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<h4>It All Begins with a Yes</h4>\n"
"<p>Your engagement to fight alongside Compassion against extreme poverty probably started with a “yes”, and for this you have our profound thanks. This “yes” has a long-lasting impact on the lives of children and families, as well as on our programs worldwide. We invite you to discover this impact in our <t t-out=\"tax_year\"></t> Activity Report, available in German or French.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"    <div style=\"margin:40px auto; text-align: center;\">\n"
"        <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/activite-2025\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#2A5EEC; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #2A5EEC; border: 1px solid #2A5EEC; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"            Your Impact in <t t-out=\"tax_year\"></t>\n"
"        </a>\n"
"    </div>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        See your impact in <t t-out=\"tax_year\"></t> in French : https://compassion.ch/activite-2025 or in German compassion.ch/de/aktivitaet-2025\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Once again, thank you for your faithful engagement alongside Compassion in the fight against injustice and extreme poverty. Together, you and other sponsors and donors, along with more than 8,700 Child Development Centers in the Global South, work to bring hope to a growing number of children and families in need.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"not major_donor\">\n"
"<p>\n"
"    We wish you a happy new year, warm regards, and until next time,\n"
"</p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p><t t-out=\"object.user_id.short_signature\"></t></p>\n"
"% endif</body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"     <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29 or not partner.title.id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dir\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deiner\" t-value=\"&#x27;eurer&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deiner&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dein\" t-value=\"&#x27;euer&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dein&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"finde\" t-value=\"&#x27;findet&#x27; if plural else &#x27;finde&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"kannst\" t-value=\"&#x27;könnt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;kannst&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"hast\" t-value=\"&#x27;habt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;hast&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tax_year\" t-value=\"2025\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"major_donor\" t-value=\"18454 in partner.category_id.ids\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"not major_donor\">\n"
"        <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"      </p><div style=\"height: 15mm\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Im vergangenen Jahr haben wir gemeinsam viel bewirkt:\n"
"</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"    <li>4066 Kinder wurden neu von der Schweiz aus unterstützt</li>\n"
"    <li>1759 Mütter und Babys erhielten lebenswichtige Hilfe</li>\n"
"    <li>100 Ausbildungsplätze für Jugendliche wurden finanziert</li>\n"
"    <li>34’775 Kinder erhielten ein Weihnachtsgeschenk</li>\n"
"    <li>4886 Familien erhielten Lebensmittelvorräte</li>\n"
"    <li>3765 Kinder haben nun Zugang zu sicheren Toiletten</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<p t-attf-style=\"{{'margin-bottom: 40px' if object.send_mode == 'digital' else ''}}\">\n"
"    All dies war dank <t t-out=\"deine\"></t>r Grosszügigkeit und Treue möglich – von Herzen Danke!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<h4><t t-out=\"deine.title()\"></t> Steuerbescheinigung <t t-out=\"tax_year\"></t></h4>\n"
"<p>\n"
"     Im Anhang senden wir <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> die Steuerbescheinigung für <t t-out=\"deine\"></t> Spenden an Compassion im Jahr <t t-out=\"tax_year\"></t>. <t t-out=\"du.title()\"></t> <t t-out=\"kannst\"></t> 100% dieses Betrages in allen Kantonen der Schweiz in der Steuererklärung abziehen.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<h4>Alles beginnt mit einem „Ja“</h4>\n"
"<p><t t-out=\"dein.title()\"></t> Engagement im Kampf gegen extreme Armut begann wahrscheinlich mit einem einfachen „Ja“. Dieses „Ja“ wirkt nachhaltig für die Kinder und Familien in unseren Programmen. <t t-out=\"&quot;Entdeckt&quot; if plural else &quot;Entdecke&quot;\"></t> in unserem\n"
"    <t t-if=\"major_donor\">\n"
"        beiliegenden\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    Jahresbericht, was <t t-out=\"dein\"></t> Engagement im vergangenen Jahr bewirkt hat.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"    <div style=\"margin:40px auto; text-align: center;\">\n"
"        <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/aktivitaet-2025\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#2A5EEC; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #2A5EEC; border: 1px solid #2A5EEC; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"            <t t-out=\"dein.title()\"></t> Impact <t t-out=\"tax_year\"></t>\n"
"        </a>\n"
"    </div>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"   <t t-if=\"not major_donor\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Den Jahresbericht 2025 <t t-out=\"finde\"></t> <t t-out=\"du\"></t> online unter : https://compassion.ch/aktivitaet-2025\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Noch einmal herzlichen Dank für <t t-out=\"dein\"></t> Engagement an unserer Seite im Kampf gegen Ungerechtigkeit und extreme Armut. Gemeinsam mit <t t-out=\"dir\"></t>, anderen Patinnen und Paten, Spenderinnen und Spendern sowie über <t t-out=\"number_fcps\"></t> Kinderzentren in <t t-out=\"number_countries\"></t> Ländern schenken wir immer mehr Kindern und Familien Hoffnung und Perspektiven.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"not major_donor\">\n"
"<p>\n"
"     Ein glückliches neues Jahr und herzliche Grüsse\n"
"</p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p><t t-out=\"object.user_id.short_signature\"></t></p>\n"
"% endif</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.mail_onboarding_photo_by_post
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorship\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorship.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"one_child\" t-value=\"len(child) == 1\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"less_4\" t-value=\"len(child) &lt; 4\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, &#x27;your sponsored children&#x27;, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"apos\" t-value=\"&quot;&#x27;&quot; if firstname[-1] == &#x27;s&#x27; else &quot;&#x27;s&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sms\" t-value=\"partner.global_communication_delivery_preference == &quot;sms&quot;\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.informal_salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    We're so pleased to send you <t t-out=\"firstname + apos + &#x27; first photo&#x27; if one_child else (&#x27;the first photos of your sponsored children&#x27; if not less_4 else firstname + apos + &#x27; first photos&#x27;)\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Thank you for making room for <t t-out=\"firstname if len(child) == 1 else &#x27;the children&#x27;\"></t> in your life and investing in <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;his&#x27;) + &#x27; future&#x27; if len(child) == 1 else &#x27;their futures&#x27;\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"partner.email or sms\">\n"
"   <p>\n"
"       Keep an eye on your emails, as we will send you all the necessary information about your <t t-out=\"&#x27;sponsorship&#x27; if one_child else &#x27;sponsorships&#x27;\"></t>.\n"
"   </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Please do not hesitate to contact us at info@compassion.ch or +41 31 552 21 21 if you have any questions.\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Together, we are changing the world! One child at a time.\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"gibst\" t-value=\"&#x27;gebt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;gibst&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"Du\" t-value=\"&#x27;Ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"Bist\" t-value=\"&#x27;Seid&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Bist&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dir\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dich\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dein\" t-value=\"&#x27;euer&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dein&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deinem\" t-value=\"&#x27;eurem&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deinem&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"investierst\" t-value=\"&#x27;investiert&#x27; if plural else &#x27;investierst&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorship\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorship.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, deine + &#x27;n Patenkindern&#x27;, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sub\" t-value=\"sponsorship.mapped(&#x27;parent_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sms\" t-value=\"partner.global_communication_delivery_preference == &quot;sms&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"len(sponsorship) &gt; 1\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"seine\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihre&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-elif=\"child.gender == &#x27;M&#x27;\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"seine\" t-value=\"&#x27;seine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"seine\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihre&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.informal_salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Wir freuen uns sehr, <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> <t t-out=\"&#x27;das erste Foto&#x27; if len(sponsorship) == 1 else &#x27;die ersten Fotos&#x27;\"></t> von <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> zu schicken.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"not sub\">\n"
"        Herzlichen Dank, dass <t t-out=\"du\"></t> <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> einen Platz in <t t-out=\"deinem\"></t> Leben <t t-out=\"gibst\"></t> und in <t t-out=\"seine\"></t> Zukunft <t t-out=\"investierst\"></t>.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        <t t-out=\"&quot;Wärt ihr&quot; if plural else &quot;Wärst du&quot;\"></t> bereit, <t t-out=\"firstname if len(child) == 1 else &quot;den Kindern&quot;\"></t> einen Platz in <t t-out=\"deine\"></t>m Leben zu geben und in <t t-out=\"seine\"></t> Zukunft zu investieren?\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"partner.email or sms\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Bitte <t t-out=\"&#x27;beachtet eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;beachte deine&#x27;\"></t> <t t-out=\"&quot;SMS&quot; if sms else &quot;E-Mails&quot;\"></t>, da wir <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> über diesen Kanal alle nötigen Informationen <t t-out=\"&#x27;zur Patenschaft&#x27; if len(child) == 1 else &#x27;zu den Patenschaften&#x27;\"></t> schicken werden.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Falls <t t-out=\"du\"></t> Fragen <t t-out=\"&#x27;habt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;hast&#x27;\"></t>, sind wir gerne für <t t-out=\"dich\"></t> da unter info@compassion.ch oder 031 552 21 21.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Gemeinsam verändern wir das Leben von Kindern - eins nach dem anderen.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.short_signature\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.mail_onboarding_zoom_reminder
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"zoom\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"partner.sponsorship_ids.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"one_child\" t-value=\"len(child) == 1\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"less_4\" t-value=\"firstname != child.get_number()\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.informal_salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    The next video conference for new sponsors is getting closer.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    You will experience what the message of a sponsorship means for a local family and you will be given more information on your sponsorship.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Have you already signed up? Don't worry, it's really straightforward!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Sign up here: <t t-out=\"zoom.get_date(&#x27;date_start&#x27;, &#x27;dd. MMMM&#x27;)\"></t> um <t t-out=\"zoom.get_date(&#x27;date_start&#x27;, &#x27;HH:mm&#x27;)\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div style=\"margin:30px auto; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"    <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/de_DE/zoom/register\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"        Registration Video Conference\n"
"    </a>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    We look forward to welcoming/seeing you!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Thank you for investing in the life of <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> and <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;his&#x27;)\"></t> <t t-out=\"&#x27;family&#x27; if one_child else &#x27;families&#x27;\"></t>. Together we are changing the world. One child at a time.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Warm regards\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"</p>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dir\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dich\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dein\" t-value=\"&#x27;euer&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dein&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"zoom\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"partner.sponsorship_ids.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"less_4\" t-value=\"firstname != child.get_number()\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.informal_salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Die nächste Videokonferenz für neue Patinnen und Paten rückt immer näher.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"&#x27;Ihr werdet&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Du wirst&#x27;\"></t> erfahren, was <t t-out=\"deine\"></t> Patenschaft bewirkt und wie sie funktioniert.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"&#x27;Seid ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Bist du&#x27;\"></t> schon angemeldet?\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Es ist ganz einfach: <t t-out=\"&#x27;Meldet euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Melde dich&#x27;\"></t> hier an: <t t-out=\"zoom.get_date(&#x27;date_start&#x27;, &#x27;dd. MMMM&#x27;)\"></t> um <t t-out=\"zoom.get_date(&#x27;date_start&#x27;, &#x27;HH:mm&#x27;)\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div style=\"margin:30px auto; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"    <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/de_DE/zoom/register\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"        Anmeldung Videokonferenz\n"
"    </a>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Danke, dass <t t-out=\"du\"></t> in das Leben von <t t-out=\"firstname if less_4 else deine + &#x27;n Patenkindern&#x27;\"></t> und <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;sein&#x27;)\"></t><t t-out=\"&#x27;er Familie&#x27; if len(child) == 1 else &#x27;en Familien&#x27;\"></t> <t t-out=\"&#x27;investiert&#x27; if plural else &#x27;investierst&#x27;\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Gemeinsam verändern wir das Leben von Kindern - eins nach dem anderen.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Liebe Grüsse\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"</p>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.mail_wrpr_volunteering
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dein\" t-value=\"&#x27;euer&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dein&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;).get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, deine + &#x27;n Patenkindern&#x27;, False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dir\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dich\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine_patenkinder\" t-value=\"&#x27;deine Patenkinder&#x27; if not plural else &#x27;eure Patenkinder&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"my_url\" t-value=\"&quot;https://stage.compassion.ch/my/home&quot; if partner.user_ids.login_date else partner.signup_url\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"chat_url\" t-value=\"my_url if partner.user_ids.login_date else &quot;https://stage.compassion.ch/im_livechat/support/2&quot;\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>7/8:\n"
