#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.email_yearly_payment_slips
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"fully_managed\" t-value=\"sponsorships.filtered(&#x27;fully_managed&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"ns\" t-value=\"namespace(correspondents = object.env[&#x27;recurring.contract&#x27;])\"/>\n"
"   <t t-set=\"is_payer\" t-value=\"partner in sponsorships.mapped(&quot;partner_id&quot;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-foreach=\"sponsorships\" t-as=\"s\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"gp\" t-value=\"s.mapped(s.send_gifts_to)\"/>\n"
"        <t t-if=\"gp == partner\">\n"
"            % set ns.correspondents = ns.correspondents + s\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"payers\" t-value=\"partner.mapped(&#x27;contracts_paid&#x27;).intersect(sponsorships)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"payment_modes\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;payment_mode_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"bvr\" t-value=\"payment_modes.intersect(object.env.ref(&#x27;sponsorship_switzerland.payment_mode_bvr&#x27;))\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"op\" t-value=\"payment_modes.intersect(object.env.ref(&#x27;sponsorship_switzerland.payment_mode_permanent_order&#x27;))\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"months_paid\" t-value=\"max(sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;months_paid&#x27;))\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"fully_managed.union(ns.correspondents).mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, &#x27;many children&#x27;, False)\"/>\n"
" <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"\n"
"    <t t-if=\"payers and (bvr or op)\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"fully_managed.union(ns.correspondents, payers).mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</div>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"        <img src=\"https://compassion.ch/medias/banners/CC-EC0534-MyLastDay-01-2506.jpg\" alt=\"merci pour votre soutien\" style=\"display: block; margin: auto; margin-bottom: 60px; width: 100%; max-width: 600px; height: auto;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>We wish you and your loved ones a happy new year full of hope!</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <b>Thank you for choosing to invest in <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>’s life.</b> Your commitment and support will have a lasting impact on <t t-out=\"children.get(&#x27;his&#x27;)\"></t> life and <t t-out=\"children.get(&#x27;his&#x27;)\"></t> loved ones, just as it did for Jennifer and so many other children in need.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Jennifer still remembers the very first time she walked into the Compassion child development center. “I was seven. I felt scared and shy. They served us a warm meal – rice, chicken, and lentils – and I can still remember its smell. From that moment on, I felt at home.”\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    But what changed her life wasn’t just hot meals and school supplies. It was  a caring community, the presence of the Church, and faith slowly taking root in her heart. Every day, the staff gently spoke truth over her life: “You are loved. You are precious. God has a purpose for you.”\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"    Today, Jennifer is studying family social work and has returned as a teacher to the very Compassion center that once welcomed her.\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<p/>\n"
"<p>\n"
"  <b>Attached you will find:</b>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"bvr and is_payer\">\n"
"        <li>\n"
"            payment slips for your sponsorship for the year <t t-out=\"str(datetime.date.today().year)\"></t>\n"
"        </li>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        three additional slips per sponsored child, should you wish to bless them with a birthday gift, support <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>’s family, or contribute to the child development center during the year <t t-out=\"str(datetime.date.today().year)\"></t>\n"
"    </li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"   <t t-if=\"bvr and is_payer\">\n"
"<p>\n"
"    You also have the option to set up a standing order for your sponsorship contributions if you wish.\n"
"</p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Please note that any “gift” donations are entirely optional - there is absolutely no obligation. Your sponsorship alone is already a beautiful and generous gift! If you happen to misplace your payment slips or would like additional ones, please don’t hesitate to contact us at 031 552 21 25 or at info@compassion.ch.\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"    We remain at your disposal for any further questions regarding your sponsorship.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <b>Thank you for being part of the Compassion family.</b> Your generosity, together with other sponsors and the work of more than <t t-out=\"number_fcps\"></t> child development centers in <t t-out=\"number_countries\"></t> countries, is bringing hope and encouragement to <t t-out=\"number_children\"></t> million children today.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"   Warm regards,\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.sudo().signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"% endif</body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29 or not partner.title\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deinen\" t-value=\"&#x27;euren&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deinen&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dein\" t-value=\"&#x27;euer&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dein&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dir\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dich\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"fully_managed\" t-value=\"sponsorships.filtered(&#x27;fully_managed&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"ns\" t-value=\"namespace(correspondents = object.env[&#x27;recurring.contract&#x27;])\"/>\n"
"   <t t-set=\"is_payer\" t-value=\"partner in sponsorships.mapped(&quot;partner_id&quot;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-foreach=\"sponsorships\" t-as=\"s\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"gp\" t-value=\"s.mapped(s.send_gifts_to)\"/>\n"
"        <t t-if=\"gp == partner\">\t\n"
"            % set ns.correspondents = ns.correspondents + s\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"payers\" t-value=\"partner.mapped(&#x27;contracts_paid&#x27;).intersect(sponsorships)      \"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"payment_modes\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;payment_mode_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"bvr\" t-value=\"payment_modes.intersect(object.env.ref(&#x27;sponsorship_switzerland.payment_mode_bvr&#x27;))\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"op\" t-value=\"payment_modes.intersect(object.env.ref(&#x27;sponsorship_switzerland.payment_mode_permanent_order&#x27;))                   \"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"months_paid\" t-value=\"max(sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;months_paid&#x27;))\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"fully_managed.union(ns.correspondents).mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, &#x27;dieser Kinder&#x27;, False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"one_child\" t-value=\"len(sponsorships) == 1\"/>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"one_child\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"boy\" t-value=\"children.gender == &#x27;M&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"dein_Patenkind\" t-value=\"dein + &#x27; Patenkind&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"dein_Patenkind\" t-value=\"deine + &#x27; Patenkinder&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"payers and (bvr or op)\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"fully_managed.union(ns.correspondents, payers).mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children_in_poverty\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;children_in_poverty&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"early_deaths\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;early_deaths&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_mothers\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_mothers&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_unacceptable_conditions\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_unacceptable_conditions&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"\n"
"    <t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"        <img src=\"https://compassion.ch/medias/banners/CC-EC0534-MyLastDay-01-2506.jpg\" alt=\"merci pour votre soutien\" style=\"display: block; margin: auto; margin-bottom: 60px; width: 100%; max-width: 600px; height: auto;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Wir wünschen <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> und <t t-out=\"deine\"></t>n Liebsten ein gutes und hoffnungsvolles neues Jahr! </p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Wir möchten <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> von Herzen für <t t-out=\"dein\"></t> treues Engagement für Kinder in extremer Armut danken. <t t-out=\"deine.title()\"></t> Unterstützung macht einen echten Unterschied im Leben <t t-out=\"&#x27;von &#x27; if len(children) &lt;= 3 else &#x27;&#x27;\"></t><t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>, <t t-out=\"&#x27;ihren Familien und ihren Gemeinschaften&#x27; if not one_child else (&#x27;seiner Familie und seiner Gemeinschaft&#x27; if boy else &#x27;ihrer Familie und ihrer Gemeinschaft&#x27;)\"></t>, die dadurch Hoffnung und neue Perspektiven erhalten. Das war zum Beispiel auch bei Jennifer der Fall.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Jennifer erinnert sich an den ersten Tag im Kinderzentrum: „Ich war sieben Jahre alt. Ich hatte Angst und war schüchtern. Doch dann bekamen wir ein warmes Mittagessen – Reis, Huhn und Linsen – und ich erinnere mich noch an den Geruch. Von Anfang an fühlte es sich wie Zuhause an.“\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Es waren nicht nur die Mahlzeiten oder die Schulmaterialien, die Jennifers Leben prägten. Es war die Gemeinschaft, die Kirche, der wachsende Glaube in ihrem Herzen. Die Mitarbeitenden erinnerten sie täglich daran: „Du bist geliebt. Du bist wertvoll. Gott hat einen Plan für dich.“\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"    Heute studiert Jennifer Familiensozialarbeit und engagiert sich als Lehrerin im Kinderzentrum, das sie selbst besucht hat.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <b>In der Beilage <t t-out=\"&quot;erhaltet&quot; if plural else &quot;erhältst&quot;\"></t> <t t-out=\"du\"></t>:</b>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"bvr and is_payer\">\n"
"        <li>\n"
"            die Einzahlungsscheine für den Patenschaftsbeitrag für das Jahr 2026\n"
"        </li>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        die Einzahlungsscheine für die Geschenke für das Jahr 2026\n"
"    </li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<t t-if=\"bvr and is_payer\">\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Wenn <t t-out=\"du\"></t> <t t-out=\"&#x27;möchtet&#x27; if plural else &#x27;möchtest&#x27;\"></t>, <t t-out=\"&#x27;könnt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;kannst&#x27;\"></t> <t t-out=\"du\"></t> gerne auch einen Dauerauftrag für den Patenschaftsbetrag einrichten.\n"
"</p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Diese Spenden sind eine zusätzliche Möglichkeit, <t t-out=\"dein_Patenkind\"></t> oder <t t-out=\"&#x27;seine Familie&#x27; if one_child else &#x27;ihre Familien&#x27;\"></t> z.B. am Geburtstag oder unter dem Jahr zu beschenken. Diese Spenden sind jedoch freiwillig, denn die Patenschaft ist bereits ein wunderbares Geschenk!\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"    Natürlich stehen wir für alle Fragen gerne zur Verfügung.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <b>Danke, dass <t t-out=\"du\"></t> Teil der Compassion-Familie <t t-out=\"&#x27;seid&#x27; if plural else &#x27;bist&#x27;\"></t>.</b> Dank <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> und den anderen Patinnen und Paten begleiten wir gemeinsam mit über <t t-out=\"number_fcps\"></t> Kinderzentren derzeit <t t-out=\"number_children\"></t> Millionen Kinder in <t t-out=\"number_countries\"></t> Ländern aus extremer Armut.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Herzliche Grüsse\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"<div style=\"margin-top: 20px;\">\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.sudo().signature\"></t>    \n"
"    </div>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.mail_wrpr_welcome
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;).get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, deine + &#x27;n Patenkindern&#x27;, False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dir\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dich\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\"/>\n"
" <t t-set=\"my_url\" t-value=\"&quot;https://stage.compassion.ch/im_livechat/support/2&quot;\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>So schön, <t t-out=\"&quot;ihr gehört&quot; if plural else &quot;du gehörst&quot;\"></t> nun zur weltweiten Compassion-Familie! Herzlich wilkommen!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p><t t-out=\"&quot;Erfahrt&quot; if plural else &quot;Erfahre&quot;\"></t> hier mehr dazu: <a href=\"https://vimeo.com/710323229/b9f3f472c5\">https://vimeo.com/710323229/b9f3f472c5</a>\n"
"</p><div>\n"
"<t t-if=\"sum(sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;total_amount&#x27;)) and partner in sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;partner_id&#x27;)\">\n"
"    <p>Damit <t t-out=\"&quot;ihr eure&quot; if plural else &quot;du deine&quot;\"></t> Spende für die <t t-out=\"sponsorships.get(&#x27;Patenschaft&#x27;)\"></t> einrichten <t t-out=\"&quot;könnt, findet ihr&quot; if plural else &quot;kannst, findest du&quot;\"></t> hier den Einzahlungsschein: <a t-attf-href=\"https://stage.compassion.ch/report/pdf/report_compassion.single_bvr_sponsorship/{{str(sponsorships[:1].id)}}\">Einzahlungsschein</a>\n"
"        <t t-if=\"partner.parent_consent == &#x27;not_submitted&#x27;\">\n"
"<br/>und die Einverständniserklärung, die wir von <t t-out=\"deine\"></t>n Eltern unterschrieben benötigen:\n"
"<a href=\"https://stage.compassion.ch/partner_compassion/static/src/img/parental_consent_de_DE.pdf\">https://stage.compassion.ch/partner_compassion/static/src/img/parental_consent_de_DE.pdf</a>\n"
"         </t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</div><p>In den kommenden Tagen werden wir <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> weitere wichtige Informationen zum Start der <t t-out=\"sponsorships.get(&#x27;Patenschaft&#x27;)\"></t> per SMS zukommen lassen. Heute sind wir bei Schritt 1/8.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Liebe Grüsse\n"
"<br/>Sarah\n"
"<br/>Tel: +41 (0)31 552 21 21\n"
"<br/>Fragen? <t t-out=\"&quot;Meldet ihr&quot; if plural else &quot;Melde dich&quot;\"></t> per Chat bei uns: <a t-attf-href=\"{{my_url}}\"><t t-out=\"my_url\"></t></a>\n"
"</p>\n"
"        </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;).get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, deine + &#x27;n Patenkindern&#x27;, False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dir\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dich\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"my_url\" t-value=\"&quot;https://mycompassion.ch/de_DE/im_livechat/support/2&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"fullstop_comma\" t-value=\"&#x27;,&#x27; if partner.age &lt; 17 else &#x27;.&#x27;\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    So schön, <t t-out=\"&quot;ihr gehört&quot; if plural else &quot;du gehörst&quot;\"></t> nun zur weltweiten Compassion-Familie! Herzlich wilkommen!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"&quot;Erfahrt&quot; if plural else &quot;Erfahre&quot;\"></t> hier mehr dazu: <a href=\"https://vimeo.com/710323229/b9f3f472c5\">https://vimeo.com/710323229/b9f3f472c5</a>\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"sum(sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;total_amount&#x27;)) and partner in sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;partner_id&#x27;)\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Damit <t t-out=\"&quot;ihr eure&quot; if plural else &quot;du deine&quot;\"></t> Spende für die <t t-out=\"sponsorships.get(&#x27;Patenschaft&#x27;)\"></t> einrichten <t t-out=\"&quot;könnt, findet ihr&quot; if plural else &quot;kannst, findest du&quot;\"></t> hier den Einzahlungsschein: <a t-attf-href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/report/pdf/report_compassion.single_bvr_sponsorship/{{str(sponsorships[:1].id)}}\">Einzahlungsschein</a><t t-out=\"fullstop_comma\"></t>\n"
"        <t t-if=\"partner.age &lt; 18 and partner.parent_consent == &#x27;not_submitted&#x27;\">\n"
"            und die Einverständniserklärung, die wir von <t t-out=\"deine\"></t>n Eltern unterschrieben benötigen: <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/partner_compassion/static/src/img/parental_consent_de_DE.pdf\"> Einverständniserklärung</a>.\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    In den kommenden Tagen werden wir <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> weitere wichtige Informationen zum Start der <t t-out=\"sponsorships.get(&#x27;Patenschaft&#x27;)\"></t> per SMS zukommen lassen. Heute sind wir bei Schritt 1/8.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Liebe Grüsse\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Sarah\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Tel: +41 (0)31 552 21 21\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Fragen? Melde dich per WhatsApp bei uns: +41 (0)79 622 31 97\n"
"</p>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.mail_onboarding_zoom_link
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"session\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Thank you for registering for the video conference for new sponsors. We look forward to meeting you online on\n"
"    <t t-out=\"session.get_date(&#x27;date_start&#x27;, &#x27;dd. MMMM&#x27;)\"></t>, showing you what your sponsorship is doing, and answering your\n"
"    questions.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Here is the link to attend the meeting at <t t-out=\"session.get_date(&#x27;date_start&#x27;, &#x27;HH:mm&#x27;)\"></t>: <t t-out=\"session.link\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    We'll be happy if you turn on the camera at the beginning of the meeting so we can see you. You can also turn\n"
"    it off afterwards if you prefer. The sound quality is best if all participants mute their microphone when they are\n"
"    not speaking.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    You can log in ten minutes before the meeting starts. If you have any technical questions, please feel free to\n"
"    contact me in advance.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Warm regards and see you soon!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"</div>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"session\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"partner.sponsorship_ids\"/>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"len(sponsorships) == 1\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"sponsorship_phrase\" t-value=\"&#x27;Patenschaft bewirkt&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"sponsorship_phrase\" t-value=\"&#x27;Patenschaften bewirken&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dein\" t-value=\"&#x27;euer&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dein&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dich\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dir\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"darfst_du_dich\" t-value=\"&#x27;dürft ihr euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;darfst du dich&#x27;\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Vielen Dank für <t t-out=\"deine\"></t> Anmeldung zur Videokonferenz für neue Patinnen und Paten.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Wir freuen uns darauf, <t t-out=\"dich\"></t> am <t t-out=\"session.get_date(&#x27;date_start&#x27;, &#x27;dd. MMMM&#x27;)\"></t> online zu treffen, <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> zu\n"
"    zeigen, was <t t-out=\"deine\"></t> <t t-out=\"sponsorship_phrase\"></t> und <t t-out=\"deine\"></t> Fragen zu beantworten.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Hier ist der Link für die Teilnahme am Treffen am <t t-out=\"session.get_date(&#x27;date_start&#x27;, &#x27;dd. MMMM&#x27;)\"></t> um <t t-out=\"session\n"
"    .get_date(&#x27;date_start&#x27;, &#x27;HH:mm&#x27;)\"></t>: <a t-attf-href=\"{{session.link}}\"><t t-out=\"session.link\"></t></a>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Es freut uns, wenn <t t-out=\"du\"></t> die Kamera zu Beginn des Meetings <t t-out=\"&#x27;anstellt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;anstellst&#x27;\"></t>, damit wir\n"
"    <t t-out=\"dich\"></t> sehen können. Danach <t t-out=\"&#x27;könnt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;kannst&#x27;\"></t> <t t-out=\"du\"></t> sie auch wieder ausschalten, wenn <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> das\n"
"    lieber ist. Am besten ist die Tonqualität, wenn alle Teilnehmenden ihr Mikrofon stummschalten, wenn sie nicht gerade selber am sprechen sind.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Ab 19:50 Uhr <t t-out=\"&#x27;könnt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;kannst&#x27;\"></t> <t t-out=\"du\"></t> <t t-out=\"dich\"></t> einloggen. Wenn <t t-out=\"du\"></t> noch technische Fragen\n"
"    <t t-out=\"&#x27;habt, könnt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;hast, kannst&#x27;\"></t> <t t-out=\"du\"></t> gerne vorgängig auf mich zukommen.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Herzliche Grüsse und bis bald!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"</p></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.mail_onboarding_zoom_registration_confirmation
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"session\" t-value=\"object.get_objects().zoom_session_id\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Thank you for your interest in the informational and sharing video conference for new sponsors.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    The meeting will take place on <t t-out=\"session.get_date(&#x27;date_start&#x27;, &#x27;dd. MMMM&#x27;)\"></t> at <t t-out=\"session.get_date(&#x27;date_start&#x27;,\n"
"    &#x27;HH:mm&#x27;)\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    We will send you all the information regarding the connection to this meeting a few days before by email or will\n"
"    inform you in case you have chosen a later date.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Warm regards\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"</div>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"session\" t-value=\"object.get_objects().zoom_session_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dir\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dich\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dein\" t-value=\"&#x27;euer&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dein&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Vielen Dank für <t t-out=\"dein\"></t> Interesse an der Videokonferenz für neue Patinnen und Paten.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Das Online-Treffen findet am <t t-out=\"session.get_date(&#x27;date_start&#x27;, &#x27;dd. MMMM&#x27;)\"></t> um <t t-out=\"session.get_date(&#x27;date_start&#x27;, &#x27;HH:mm&#x27;)\"></t> statt.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Alle benötigten Informationen zum Treffen senden wir <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> einige Tage vorher per E-Mail zu. Falls <t t-out=\"du\"></t> angekreuzt <t t-out=\"&quot;habt&quot; if plural else &quot;hast&quot;\"></t>, dass <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> dieses Datum nicht passt, werden wir <t t-out=\"dich\"></t> zu einem späteren Zeitpunkt über einen neuen Termin informieren.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Wir freuen uns auf <t t-out=\"dich\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Liebe Grüsse\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"</div>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.email_sponsorship_birthday_reminder
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"he\" t-value=\"child.get(&#x27;he&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"him\" t-value=\"child.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"month\" t-value=\"child.get_date(&#x27;birthdate&#x27;, &#x27;MMMM d&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"hold_gifts\" t-value=\"child.get_hold_gifts()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"already_paid\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;birthday_paid&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"send_gifts_to\" t-value=\"sponsorships[:1] and sponsorships.mapped(sponsorships[0].send_gifts_to)[:1]\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"does_write\" t-value=\"partner == sponsorships[:1].correspondent_id and 23 not in partner.category_id.ids\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"can_gift\" t-value=\"not hold_gifts and not already_paid and send_gifts_to == partner\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"mycompassion_url\" t-value=\"&#x27;https://www.mycompassion.ch&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"gift_form_url\" t-value=\"&#x27;https://compassion.ch/de/geschenkformular&#x27;\"/>\n"
"\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    It's <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>'s birthday on <t t-out=\"month\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"len(child) == 1\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;He&#x27;)\"></t> will be <t t-out=\"child[:1].age + 1\"></t> years old this year.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-if=\"does_write\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        We invite you to write a few words of encouragement to <t t-out=\"him\"></t> online via <a t-att-href=\"mycompassion_url\">MyCompassion</a>.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Imagine the joy when <t t-out=\"he\"></t> receives a letter from you!*\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"can_gift\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        If you would also like to give <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> a present, you can do so <t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;physical&#x27;\">using the attached payment slip or </t><a t-att-href=\"gift_form_url\">online</a>.*\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Thank you for making a difference in <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>'s life.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"does_write or can_gift\">\n"
"    <blockquote>\n"
"        <small>*It is possible that this message crossed with your letter or donation.</small>\n"
"    </blockquote>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Kind regards,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"/>\n"
"</t>\n"
"\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"month\" t-value=\"child.get_date(&#x27;birthdate&#x27;, &#x27;d. MMMM&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"already_paid\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;birthday_paid&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"hold_gifts\" t-value=\"child.get_hold_gifts()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"send_gifts_to\" t-value=\"sponsorships[:1] and sponsorships.mapped(sponsorships[0].send_gifts_to)[:1]\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"does_write\" t-value=\"partner == sponsorships[:1].correspondent_id and 23 not in partner.category_id.ids\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"can_gift\" t-value=\"not hold_gifts and not already_paid and send_gifts_to == partner\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sms_can_gift\" t-value=\"partner.has_majority or partner.parent_consent == &#x27;approved&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dich\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"mycompassion_letter_url\" t-value=\"&#x27;https://mycompassion.ch/de/my/letter&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"gift_form_url\" t-value=\"&#x27;https://compassion.ch/de/geschenkformular&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"wp_tchat_url\" t-value=\"&quot;https://mycompassion.ch/de/im_livechat/support/2&quot;\"/>\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;sms&quot;\">\n"
"    <p t-out=\"partner.salutation\"/>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Am <t t-out=\"month\"></t> feiert <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;seinen&#x27;)\"></t> Geburtstag.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"&#x27;Stellt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Stell&#x27;\"></t> <t t-out=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"></t> die grosse Freude vor, wenn man vom anderen Ende der Welt Geburtstagswünsche bekommt. Zu wissen, dass sich jemand um einen kümmert und dass man nicht alleine ist, ist ein Geschenk von unbezahlbarem Wert.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"&quot;Ihr könnt&quot; if plural else &quot;Du kannst&quot;\"></t> über MyCompassion schreiben: <a t-att-href=\"mycompassion_letter_url\">mycompassion.ch</a>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"can_gift and sms_can_gift\">\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            Falls <t t-out=\"du\"></t> <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> zusätzlich gerne etwas schenken <t t-out=\"&#x27;möchtet&#x27; if plural else &#x27;möchtest&#x27;\"></t>, <t t-out=\"&#x27;könnt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;kannst&#x27;\"></t> <t t-out=\"du\"></t> das hier tun: <a t-att-href=\"gift_form_url\">online</a>.\n"
"        </p>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Danke, dass <t t-out=\"du\"></t> in das Leben von <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> <t t-out=\"&quot;investiert&quot; if plural else &quot;investierst&quot;\"></t>.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Liebe Grüsse<br/>\n"
"        Sarah<br/>\n"
"        Tel: +41 (0)31 552 21 21<br/>\n"
"        Fragen? <a t-att-href=\"wp_tchat_url\"><t t-out=\"wp_tchat_url\"></t></a>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"    <p t-out=\"partner.salutation\"/>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Am <t t-out=\"month\"></t> feiert <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;seinen&#x27;)\"></t> Geburtstag.\n"
"        <t t-if=\"len(child) == 1\">\n"
"            <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;will be&#x27;)\"></t> dieses Jahr <t t-out=\"str(child.age+1)\"></t> Jahre alt.\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"does_write\">\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            <t t-out=\"&#x27;Nehmt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Nimm&#x27;\"></t> <t t-out=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"></t> doch kurz Zeit, <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> über <a t-att-href=\"mycompassion_letter_url\">MyCompassion</a> zu ermutigen.\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            <t t-out=\"&#x27;Stellt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Stell&#x27;\"></t> <t t-out=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"></t> die grosse Freude vor, wenn <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;he&#x27;)\"></t> einen Brief von <t t-out=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"></t> bekommt!*\n"
"        </p>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"can_gift\">\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            Falls <t t-out=\"du\"></t> <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> zusätzlich gerne etwas schenken <t t-out=\"&#x27;möchtet&#x27; if plural else &#x27;möchtest&#x27;\"></t>, <t t-out=\"&#x27;könnt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;kannst&#x27;\"></t> <t t-out=\"du\"></t> das <t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;physical&#x27;\">entweder mit dem angehängten Einzahlungsschein oder </t><a t-att-href=\"gift_form_url\">online</a> tun.*\n"
"        </p>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Danke, dass <t t-out=\"du\"></t> <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> <t t-out=\"&quot;ermutigt&quot; if plural else &quot;ermutigst&quot;\"></t> und <t t-out=\"dich\"></t> für <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;ihn&#x27;)\"></t> einsetzt.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"does_write or can_gift\">\n"
"        <blockquote>\n"
"            <small>*Möglicherweise hat sich diese Nachricht mit <t t-out=\"&#x27;eurem&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deinem&#x27;\"></t> Brief oder <t t-out=\"&#x27;eurer&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deiner&#x27;\"></t> Spende gekreuzt.</small>\n"
"        </blockquote>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Liebe Grüsse\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"        <p t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</t></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.email_wrpr_dossier
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"payer\" t-value=\"object.partner_id in sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;partner_id&#x27;) and len(sponsorships.filtered(&#x27;period_paid&#x27;)) != len(sponsorships)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.informal_salutation\"></t>,\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Welcome to the Compassion Family!\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Thank you for your commitment to <t t-out=\"&#x27;another &#x27; if sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;parent_id&#x27;) or len(object.partner_id.sponsorship_ids) != len(sponsorships) else &#x27;&#x27;\"></t>child in poverty. You have made a great decision! You will be changing the life of <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;his&#x27;)\"></t> family.\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    In a few days time, <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> will learn that <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;he&#x27;)\"></t> <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;has&#x27;)\"></t> a sponsor. It will be a day of joy for <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"></t> and <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;his&#x27;)\"></t> family.\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    So that the sponsorship runs smoothly, enclosed you will find some important information and documents to help you get started:\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        1 photo of your sponsored child\n"
"    </li>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        1 dossier with practical information about this sponsorship\n"
"        <br/>\n"
"    </li>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        1 letter template so that you can introduce yourself to the child\n"
"        <br/>\n"
"    </li>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        1 sheet of labels to use each time you write letters to the child (1 label each with a reference number to whatever you send-- each letter, card, drawing, booklet, etc.)\n"
"        <br/>\n"
"    </li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    The special feature of a “Write &amp; Pray” sponsorship is teamwork. The sponsored child will come to know you as <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;his&#x27;)\"></t> sponsor.  We are depending on you to pray for the child and to write to <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"></t> at least 2x per year while another donor provides the <t t-out=\"&#x27;missing &#x27; if payer else &#x27;&#x27;\"></t>financial support for <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;the child&#x27;)\"></t>.\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    We wish you and <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> much joy and blessing in corresponding with one another!\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    If you have any questions, please do not hesitate to contact us.\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Best regards,\n"
"</p>\n"
" </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"<t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dir\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dich\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dein\" t-value=\"&#x27;euer&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dein&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;  \"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"less_4\" t-value=\"firstname != child.get_number()\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"payer\" t-value=\"object.partner_id in sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;partner_id&#x27;) and len(sponsorships.filtered(&#x27;period_paid&#x27;)) != len(sponsorships)\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"correspondant\" t-value=\"object.partner_id in sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;correspondent_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"<div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dir\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dich\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dein\" t-value=\"&#x27;euer&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dein&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;  \"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"less_4\" t-value=\"firstname != child.get_number()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"payer\" t-value=\"object.partner_id in sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;partner_id&#x27;) and len(sponsorships.filtered(&#x27;period_paid&#x27;)) != len(sponsorships)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"correspondant\" t-value=\"object.partner_id in sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;correspondent_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children_in_poverty\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;children_in_poverty&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<div style=\"font-size:8pt\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>\n"
"        <br/>\n"
"        <br/>\n"
"        So schön, dass <t t-out=\"du\"></t> nun zur Familie von Compassion Schweiz <t t-out=\"&#x27;gehört&#x27; if plural else &#x27;gehörst&#x27;\"></t>!\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Mit <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> zusammen befreien wir zurzeit mit rund <t t-out=\"number_fcps\"></t> Partnerkirchen in <t t-out=\"number_countries\"></t> Ländern <t t-out=\"number_children\"></t> Millionen Kinder aus extremer Armut. Gemeinsam ermöglichen wir den Kindern ein Leben mit Hoffnung und Zukunft.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;physical&quot;\">\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            Damit die <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;Patenschaft&#x27;)\"></t> für <t t-out=\"firstname if less_4 else deine + &#x27; Patenkinder&#x27;\"></t> gut starten <t t-out=\"&#x27;kann&#x27; if len(child) == 1 else &#x27;können&#x27;\"></t>, <t t-out=\"&#x27;findet ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;findest du&#x27;\"></t> einige wichtige Informationen beigelegt:\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <ul>\n"
"            <li>1 Foto von <t t-out=\"firstname if less_4 else &#x27;jedem Kind&#x27;\"></t></li>\n"
"            <li>1 Patenschaftsdossier mit praktischen Informationen</li>\n"
"            <t t-if=\"correspondant\">\n"
"                <li><t t-out=\"&quot;1 Blatt&quot; if len(child) == 1 else &quot;Blätter&quot;\"></t> mit Etiketten für den Briefwechsel (bitte auf Karten, Briefe, Aufkleber, Zeichnungen usw. kleben)</li>\n"
"            </t>\n"
"        </ul>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-if=\"payer\">\n"
"            Um <t t-out=\"deine\"></t> Unterstützung für <t t-out=\"firstname if less_4 else &#x27;die Kinder&#x27;\"></t> weiterzuführen, sind wir dankbar <t t-out=\"dir\"></t>, wenn <t t-out=\"du\"></t>\n"
"            <t t-if=\"lsv_dd\">\n"
"                die Einzugsermächtigung für die Bank <t t-out=\"&quot;ausfüllt&quot; if plural else &quot;ausfüllst&quot;\"></t> und uns per Post <t t-out=\"&quot;zurückschickt&quot; if plural else &quot;zurückschickst&quot;\"></t>.\n"
"            </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"                den Dauerauftrag mit dem beiliegenden Einzahlungsschein <t t-out=\"&quot;aktiviert&quot; if plural else &quot;aktivierst&quot;\"></t>. \n"
"            </t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"        Falls <t t-out=\"du\"></t> noch Fragen <t t-out=\"&quot;habt&quot; if plural else &quot;hast&quot;\"></t>, sind wir gerne für <t t-out=\"dich\"></t> da. \n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Vielen Dank, dass <t t-out=\"du\"></t> in das Leben von <t t-out=\"firstname if less_4 else &quot;vielen Kindern&quot;\"></t> <t t-out=\"&quot;investiert&quot; if plural else &quot;investierst&quot;\"></t>!\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <div style=\"font-size:8pt\">\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>\n"
"            <br/>\n"
"            <br/>\n"
"            <t t-if=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;parent_id&#x27;) or len(object.partner_id.sponsorship_ids) != len(sponsorships)\">\n"
"                So schön, dass <t t-out=\"du\"></t> <t t-out=\"dich\"></t> entschieden <t t-out=\"&#x27;habt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;hast&#x27;\"></t>, in das Leben <t t-out=\"&#x27;eines weiteren Kindes&#x27; if len(child) == 1 else &#x27;weiterer Kinder&#x27;\"></t> zu investieren.\n"
"            </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"                So schön, dass <t t-out=\"du\"></t> nun zur Compassion Familie <t t-out=\"&#x27;gehört&#x27; if plural else &#x27;gehörst&#x27;\"></t> !\n"
"            </t>\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            Mit <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> zusammen befreien wir zurzeit mit rund 8'700 Partnerkirchen in 29 Ländern 2,3 Millionen Kinder aus extremer Armut. Gemeinsam ermöglichen wir den Kindern ein Leben mit Hoffnung und Zukunft.\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <t t-if=\"not sponsorships.filtered(&#x27;total_amount&#x27;)\">\n"
"            <p>\n"
"                In ein paar Tagen <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;will be&#x27;)\"></t> <t t-out=\"firstname if less_4 else deine + &#x27; Patenkinder&#x27;\"></t> erfahren, dass <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;he&#x27;)\"></t> \n"
"                <t t-if=\"not plural\">\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"&quot;eine Patin&quot; if partner.gender == &quot;F&quot; else &quot;einen Paten&quot;\"></t>\n"
"                </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"                    Paten\n"
"                </t>\n"
"                bekommen <t t-out=\"&quot;hat&quot; if len(child) == 1 else &quot;haben&quot;\"></t>. Das wird für <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;ihn&#x27;)\"></t> und <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;seine&#x27;)\"></t> Familie<t t-out=\"&#x27;n&#x27; if len(child) != 1 else &#x27;&#x27;\"></t> ein Freudentag sein! \n"
"            </p>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            Damit die <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;Patenschaft&#x27;)\"></t> für <t t-out=\"firstname if less_4 else deine + &#x27; Patenkinder&#x27;\"></t> gut starten <t t-out=\"&#x27;kann&#x27; if len(child) == 1 else &#x27;können&#x27;\"></t>, <t t-out=\"&#x27;findet ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;findest du&#x27;\"></t> einige wichtige Informationen beigelegt:\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <ul>\n"
"            <li>1 Foto von <t t-out=\"firstname if less_4 else &#x27;jedem Kind&#x27;\"></t></li>\n"
"            <li>1 Patenschaftsdossier mit praktischen Informationen</li>\n"
"            <t t-if=\"correspondant\">\n"
"                <li><t t-out=\"&quot;1 Vorstellungskarte&quot; if len(sponsorships) == 1 else &quot;Vorstellungskarten&quot;\"></t>, um <t t-out=\"dich\"></t> <t t-out=\"deine\"></t><t t-out=\"&#x27;m Patenkind&#x27; if len(child) == 1 else &#x27;n Patenkindern&#x27;\"></t> vorzustellen</li>\n"
"                <li><t t-out=\"&quot;1 Blatt&quot; if len(sponsorships) == 1 else &quot;Blätter&quot;\"></t> mit Etiketten für den Briefwechsel (bitte auf Karten, Briefe, Aufkleber, Zeichnungen usw. kleben)</li>\n"
"            </t>\n"
"        </ul>\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            Das Besondere an einer \"Write &amp; Pray\" Patenschaft ist die Teamarbeit. <t t-out=\"du.title()\"></t> <t t-out=\"&#x27;seid&#x27; if plural else &#x27;bist&#x27;\"></t> <t t-out=\"partner.get(&#x27;der&#x27;)\"></t> <t t-out=\"&#x27;Paten&#x27; if plural else partner.get(&#x27;Pate&#x27;)\"></t>, <t t-out=\"partner.get(&#x27;der&#x27;)\"></t> <t t-out=\"firstname if less_4 else deine + &#x27;n Patenkindern&#x27;\"></t> mindestens zwei Mal im Jahr einen Brief <t t-out=\"&quot;schreiben&quot; if plural else &quot;schreibt&quot;\"></t> und für <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;ihn&#x27;)\"></t> <t t-out=\"&quot;beten&quot; if plural else &quot;betet&quot;\"></t>. \n"
"\n"
"            <t t-if=\"payer\">\n"
"                Um <t t-out=\"deine\"></t> Unterstützung für <t t-out=\"firstname if less_4 else &#x27;die Kinder&#x27;\"></t> zu starten, sind wir <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> dankbar, wenn <t t-out=\"du\"></t>\n"
"                <t t-if=\"lsv_dd\">\n"
"                    die Einzugsermächtigung für die Bank <t t-out=\"&quot;ausfüllt&quot; if plural else &quot;ausfüllst&quot;\"></t> und uns per Post <t t-out=\"&quot;zurückschickt&quot; if plural else &quot;zurückschickst&quot;\"></t>.\n"
"                </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"                    den Dauerauftrag mit dem beiliegenden Einzahlungsschein baldmöglichst <t t-out=\"&quot;aktiviert&quot; if plural else &quot;aktivierst&quot;\"></t>. \n"
"                </t>\n"
"                Ein anderer Spender übernimmt den Restbetrag der finanziellen <t t-out=\"&quot;Unterstützung für &quot; + firstname if less_4 else &quot;Unterstützung der Kinder&quot;\"></t>. Nachdem <t t-out=\"deine\"></t> erste Patenschaftsspende eingetroffen ist, <t t-out=\"child.get(&quot;will be&quot;)\"></t> <t t-out=\"firstname if less_4 else &quot;die Kinder&quot;\"></t> darüber informiert, dass <t t-out=\"child.get(&quot;he&quot;)\"></t> nun\n"
"                <t t-if=\"not plural\">\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"&quot;eine Patin&quot; if partner.gender == &quot;F&quot; else &quot;einen Paten&quot;\"></t>\n"
"                </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"                    Paten\n"
"                </t>\n"
"                <t t-out=\"&quot;hat&quot; if len(child) == 1 else &quot;haben&quot;\"></t>. <t t-out=\"&quot;Könnt ihr euch&quot; if plural else &quot;Kannst du dir&quot;\"></t> die grosse Freude über diese Nachricht vorstellen?\n"
"            </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"                Ein anderer Spender sorgt für die finanzielle Unterstützung. \n"
"            </t>\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            Dank <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> findet nicht nur ein Kind, sondern eine ganze Familie neue Hoffnung für die Zukunft.\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            Vielen Dank, dass <t t-out=\"du\"></t> diese Entscheidung für <t t-out=\"firstname if less_4 else deine + &quot; Patenkinder&quot;\"></t> getroffen <t t-out=\"&quot;habt&quot; if plural else &quot;hast&quot;\"></t>! Wir wünschen <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> viel Freude dabei. Falls <t t-out=\"du\"></t> noch Fragen <t t-out=\"&quot;habt&quot; if plural else &quot;hast&quot;\"></t>, sind wir gerne für <t t-out=\"dich\"></t> da. \n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            Gemeinsam verändern wir das Leben von Kindern - eins nach dem anderen. \n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            Liebe Grüsse\n"
"        </p>\n"
"    </div>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Wir wünschen <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> viel Freude dabei.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Gemeinsam verändern wir das Leben von Kindern - eins nach dem anderen. \n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Liebe Grüsse\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            PS: <t t-out=\"&#x27;Habt ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Hast du&#x27;\"></t> gewusst, dass <t t-out=\"du\"></t> <t t-out=\"deine + &quot;m Patenkind&quot; if len(child) == 1 else deine + &quot;n Patenkindern&quot;\"></t> schnell und einfach entweder über <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/de_DE\">MyCompassion</a> oder <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/de/app\">die Compassion App</a> schreiben <t t-out=\"&quot;könnt&quot; if plural else &quot;kannst&quot;\"></t>? An beiden Orten <t t-out=\"&quot;habt ihr&quot; if plural else &quot;hast du&quot;\"></t> die Bilder, Briefe und alle Informationen <t t-out=\"(deine + &#x27;s Patenkindes&#x27;) if len(child) == 1 else (deine + &#x27;r Patenkinder&#x27;)\"></t> immer zur Hand.\n"
"        </p>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.email_invalid_email
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"   <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"   \n"
"<t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"partner.sponsorship_ids\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <t t-if=\"sponsorships\">\n"
"\tThank you for investing in the life of <t t-out=\"sponsorships.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, translate=False)\"></t> with a sponsorship.\n"
"\t</t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"\tThank you for your concern for children living in extreme poverty.\n"
"</t>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   We have sent you an e-mail to the following address: <t t-out=\"partner.email or &#x27;&#x27;\"></t> . Unfortunately, it seems to not have reached you. Have you changed your email address or did the email end up in your spam?\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   May we ask you to contact us to give us your new email address or that you add \"info@compassion\" to your contact list, in case the email reached you? You can reach us by phone at 031 552 21 21 or write us to info@compassion.ch.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Once again, thank you for your commitment. Together we are able to tranform the lives of currently 2.3 million children in 29 countries in a sustainable way.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Sincerely,\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   PS: Do you already have the Compassion app? With it you always have your sponsored child's pictures, letters and all information at hand. And the letter writing is made even easier. Download here: www.compassion.ch/app\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"  </p>\n"
" </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"partner.sponsorship_ids\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dein\" t-value=\"&#x27;euer&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dein&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Leider erreichen <t t-out=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\"></t> unsere E-Mails nicht.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Wir haben eine E-Mail an diese Adresse geschickt: <t t-out=\"partner.email\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"&#x27;Habt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Hast&#x27;\"></t> <t t-out=\"du\"></t> <t t-out=\"deine\"></t> E-Mail-Adresse geändert oder ist die Nachricht vielleicht im Spam-Ordner gelandet?\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Bitte <t t-out=\"&#x27;gebt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;gib&#x27;\"></t> uns Bescheid, falls <t t-out=\"du\"></t> eine neue E-Mail-Adresse <t t-out=\"&#x27;habt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;hast&#x27;\"></t> oder <t t-out=\"&#x27;fügt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;füge&#x27;\"></t> compassion@compassion.ch zu <t t-out=\"deine\"></t>m Adressbuch hinzu, falls <t t-out=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\"></t> unsere E-Mail doch erreicht hat.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Danke, dass <t t-out=\"du\"></t> in das Leben von Kindern in Armut <t t-out=\"&#x27;investiert&#x27; if plural else &#x27;investierst&#x27;\"></t>. Gemeinsam verändern wir nachhaltig das Leben von <t t-out=\"number_children\"></t> Millionen Kindern in <t t-out=\"number_countries\"></t> Ländern.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Liebe Grüsse\n"
"</p>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.email_address_change
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"   <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"address\" t-value=\"partner.short_address\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Thank you for investing in the lives of children in extreme poverty.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   We have sent you mail to the following address:\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <t t-out=\"address\"></t>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Unfortunately, the letter did not reach you. Have you moved? If so, we would be pleased if you could tell us your new address.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Your support of children in extreme poverty is valuable.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   At Compassion, we believe that you are giving them the chance to live a dignified and meaningful life. <t t-out=\"object.success_sentence or &#x27;&#x27;\"></t>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Once again, thank you for your commitment so that together we can positively transform the lives of currrently more than 2.3 million children in 29 countries.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Sincerely,\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <t t-out=\"object.user_id.preferred_name\"></t> <t t-out=\"object.user_id.lastname\"></t>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <t t-out=\"object.user_id.employee_ids.department_id.name\"></t>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <t t-out=\"object.user_id.company_id.address_name\"></t>\n"
"</t>\n"
"  </p>\n"
" </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"address\" t-value=\"partner.short_address\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dein\" t-value=\"&#x27;euer&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dein&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Leider erreicht <t t-out=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\"></t> unsere Post nicht.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Wir haben <t t-out=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"></t> Post an diese Adresse geschickt:\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"address\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"&#x27;Seid&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Bist&#x27;\"></t> <t t-out=\"du\"></t> umgezogen? Bitte <t t-out=\"&#x27;gebt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;gib&#x27;\"></t> uns Bescheid, falls <t t-out=\"du\"></t>\n"
"    eine neue Adresse <t t-out=\"&#x27;habt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;hast&#x27;\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Danke, dass <t t-out=\"du\"></t> in das Leben von Kindern in Armut <t t-out=\"&#x27;investiert&#x27; if plural else &#x27;investierst&#x27;\"></t>. Gemeinsam verändern wir nachhaltig das Leben von <t t-out=\"number_children\"></t> Millionen Kindern in <t t-out=\"number_countries\"></t> Ländern.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Liebe Grüsse\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"</t>\n"
" </body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.email_sponsorship_birthday_1day_reminder
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"   <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"name\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"one\" t-value=\"len(child) == 1\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"letters\" t-value=\"object.env[&#x27;correspondence&#x27;].search([(&#x27;sponsorship_id&#x27;, &#x27;in&#x27;, sponsorships.ids), (&#x27;scanned_date&#x27;, &#x27;&gt;=&#x27;, (datetime.datetime.now() - relativedelta(months=3)).strftime(&#x27;%Y-%m-%d&#x27;)), (&#x27;direction&#x27;, &#x27;=&#x27;, &#x27;Supporter To Beneficiary&#x27;)])\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"month\" t-value=\"child.get_date(&#x27;birthdate&#x27;, &#x27;date_month&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"already_paid\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;birthday_paid&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"paid_date\" t-value=\"already_paid and already_paid[0] and already_paid[0].get_date(&#x27;date_partner_paid&#x27;, &#x27;date_full&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"hold_gifts\" t-value=\"child.get_hold_gifts()\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"send_gifts_to\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(sponsorships[0].send_gifts_to)[0]\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"does_write\" t-value=\"partner == sponsorships[0].correspondent_id and 23 not in partner.category_id.ids\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Tomorrow, it’s <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;your sponsored child&#x27;)\"></t> <t t-out=\"name\"></t>'s birthday! Thanks to your sponsorship, <t t-out=\"name\"></t> has been able to enjoy another year at the project.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <t t-if=\"does_write and not letters\">\n"
"\tIf you haven’t sent a greeting yet, would you be willing to send <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"></t> some birthday wishes? A few heartfelt and appreciative words encourage the children greatly and demonstrates that they are valuable.  You can write him online at:\n"
"   <a t-attf-href=\"https://my.compassion.ch/r/fVN?email={{partner.email}}&amp;pname={{partner.name}}&amp;sponsor_ref={{partner.ref}}&amp;child_ref={{child.local_id if len(child) == 1 else ''}}\">\n"
"    www.compassion.ch/ecrire\n"
"   </a>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   </t>\n"
"<t t-if=\"not hold_gifts and not already_paid and send_gifts_to == partner\">\n"
"\tDid you know you can also send a birthday present to <t t-out=\"name\"></t>? If you would like, you can still\n"
"   <a t-attf-href=\"https://my.compassion.ch/r/njq?fund_code=Anniversaire&amp;last_name={{partner.lastname}}&amp;first_name={{partner.firstname}}&amp;street={{partner.street}}&amp;zipcode={{partner.zip}}&amp;city={{partner.city}}&amp;email={{partner.email}}&amp;child_ref={{child.local_id if len(child) == 1 else ''}}&amp;country={{partner.country_id.name}}\">\n"
"    send your sponsored child a birthday present\n"
"   </a>\n"
"   (between 20.-100 CHF.-maximum).  Together, with an employee from the project who knows <t t-out=\"name\"></t> well; a useful present or presents will be chosen and purchased. Just imagine the joy on their face in a few months when they realize you have sent them a birthday gift!\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   </t>\n"
"   Thank you for investing in the life of <t t-out=\"name\"></t>. In partnership with you and more than one million sponsors worldwide, the lives of 2.3 million children living in extreme poverty are being transformed. Michelle in the Philippines, who now runs her own NGO to help victims of human trafficking, is one example of many other former sponsored children who are now changing the lives of many other children.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Thanks again for your generous commitment.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Best regards,\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Carole Rochat\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Sponsor and Donor services\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Compassion Switzerland\n"
"  </p>\n"
" </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dein\" t-value=\"&#x27;euer&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dein&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"name\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"one\" t-value=\"len(child) == 1\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"letters\" t-value=\"object.env[&#x27;correspondence&#x27;].search([(&#x27;sponsorship_id&#x27;, &#x27;in&#x27;, sponsorships.ids), (&#x27;scanned_date&#x27;, &#x27;&gt;=&#x27;, (datetime.datetime.now() - relativedelta(months=3)).strftime(&#x27;%Y-%m-%d&#x27;)), (&#x27;direction&#x27;, &#x27;=&#x27;, &#x27;Supporter To Beneficiary&#x27;)])\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"month\" t-value=\"child.get_date(&#x27;birthdate&#x27;, &#x27;date_month&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"already_paid\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;birthday_paid&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"paid_date\" t-value=\"already_paid and already_paid[0] and already_paid[0].get_date(&#x27;date_partner_paid&#x27;, &#x27;date_full&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"hold_gifts\" t-value=\"child.get_hold_gifts()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"send_gifts_to\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(sponsorships[0].send_gifts_to)[0]\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"does_write\" t-value=\"partner == sponsorships[0].correspondent_id and 23 not in partner.category_id.ids\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"age\" t-value=\"str(child.age + 1)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Morgen hat <t t-out=\"name\"></t> Geburtstag und wird <t t-out=\"age\"></t> Jahre alt!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Dank <t t-out=\"deine\"></t>r Patenschaft konnte <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;he&#x27;)\"></t> ein weiteres Jahr an den Programmen und Aktivitäten des Kinderzentrums teilnehmen. Herzlichen Dank!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"does_write and not letters\">\n"
"        <t t-out=\"&#x27;Nehmt euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Nimm dir&#x27;\"></t> doch kurz Zeit, <t t-out=\"name\"></t> mit einem Brief zu zeigen, wie wertvoll <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;he&#x27;)\"></t> ist. <t t-out=\"du.title()\"></t> <t t-out=\"&#x27;könnt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;kannst&#x27;\"></t> <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;ihm&#x27;)\"></t>\n"
"        <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/de_DE/\">\n"
"            über MyCompassion\n"
"        </a>\n"
"        schreiben.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"not hold_gifts and not already_paid and send_gifts_to == partner\">\n"
"        Falls <t t-out=\"du\"></t> <t t-out=\"name\"></t> zusätzlich gerne etwas schenken <t t-out=\"&#x27;möchtet, könnt ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;möchtest, kannst \n"
"    du&#x27;\"></t> das entweder mit dem angehängten Einzahlungsschein\n"
"\n"
"        <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/de/geschenkformular\">\n"
"<!--        <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/de/schenken?<t t-out=\"partner.with_context(mailchimp_child=child).wordpress_form_data\"></t>\"> -->\n"
"            oder online\n"
"        </a>\n"
"        tun.*\n"
"</t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Liebe Grüsse\n"
"</p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    *Möglicherweise hat sich diese Nachricht mit <t t-out=\"deine\"></t>m Brief oder <t t-out=\"deine\"></t>r Spende gekreuzt.\n"
"</p>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.sms_confirmation_email_2
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"   <t t-set=\"sponsorship\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorship.child_id\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"transaction_done\" t-value=\"sponsorship.state == &#x27;active&#x27;\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   Hello,\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Thank you for your commitment towards <t t-out=\"child.preferred_name\"></t>.\n"
"<t t-if=\"not transaction_done\">\n"
"Now that all information is completed, we will activate your sponsorship. <t t-out=\"child.preferred_name\"></t> will be informed as soon as you pay your first donation.\n"
"</t>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   You will receive more documentation by post in the coming days. In the mean time, feel free to reach us if you have any question.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Best regards,\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"    Carole Rochat\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Sponsor and Donor services\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Compassion Switzerland\n"
"</t>\n"
"  </p>\n"
" </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"   <t t-set=\"sponsorship\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorship.child_id\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"transaction_done\" t-value=\"sponsorship.state == &#x27;active&#x27;\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   Hallo <t t-out=\"partner.firstname\"></t>\n"
"  </p>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   Herzlichen Dank für dein Engagement für <t t-out=\"child.preferred_name\"></t>. Wir haben deine Angaben erhalten.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"  </p>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   Behalte deinen Briefkasten im Auge! Wir schicken dir ein komplettes Dossier zur Patenschaft mit einem Foto von <t t-out=\"child.preferred_name\"></t>, einem Leitfaden, Informationen über das Land etc.\n"
"  </p>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   Wenn du Fragen zur Patenschaft hast, sind wir gerne für dich da.\n"
"  </p>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Herzliche Grüsse\n"
"<br/>\n"
"<t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"  </p>\n"
" </body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.sms_reminder_email
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"   <t t-set=\"sponsorship\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"sponsorship.partner_id\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorship.child_id\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"url\" t-value=\"&quot;%s/child/%s/sponsor/confirmation?face_reveal=1&quot; % (partner.get_base_url(), child.id)\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   Hello,\n"
"  </p>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   3 days ago, you chose to invest in the life of <t t-out=\"child.preferred_name\"></t>.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   There are 2 steps left before <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;he&#x27;)\"></t> will be informed that you sponsor <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"></t>.                    Please consider finishing your request and you will begin to release <t t-out=\"child.preferred_name\"></t> from poverty, for a purposeful life.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   1.\n"
"   <a t-attf-href=\"{{url}}\" style=\"color:#0055A6;text-decoration: underline;\">\n"
"    Click here\n"
"   </a>\n"
"   to complete your information and your payment option.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   2. Your sponsorship will be activated when we receive your first payment.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   In the unlikely case you don't want to sponsor this child anymore, please contact us quickly by e-mail or by phone at 031 552 21 25. We will then try to find another sponsor for <t t-out=\"child.preferred_name\"></t>.\n"
"  </p>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   A sponsorship changes a child's life forever. Michelle has grown in extrem poverty in the Philippines. She has been sponsored and created her own NGO to rescue human trafic victims.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Best regards\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"    Carole Rochat\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Sponsor and Donor services\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Compassion Switzerland\n"
"</t>\n"
"  </p>\n"
" </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorship\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"sponsorship.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorship.child_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"url\" t-value=\"&quot;%s/child/%s/sponsor/confirmation?face_reveal=1&quot; % (partner.get_base_url(), child.id)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Hallo!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Danke, dass du dich entschieden hast, in das Leben von <t t-out=\"child.preferred_name\"></t> zu investieren.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Bitte <a t-attf-href=\"{{url}}\">ergänze hier</a> noch deine Angaben.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Falls du Fragen hast, sind wir gerne für dich da unter <a href=\"mailto:info@compassion.ch\">info@compassion.ch</a> oder 031 552 21 21.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Bitte beachte deine E-Mails, da wir dir über diesen Kanal alle nötigen Informationen zur Patenschaft schicken werden.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Gemeinsam verändern wir das Leben von Kindern - eins nach dem anderen.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Liebe Grüsse vom Compassion Team\n"
"</p>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.email_sponsorship_welcome_activation
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"   <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), False)\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"intro\" t-value=\"&#x27;a child&#x27; if len(partner.sponsorship_ids) == 1 else &#x27;a new child&#x27;\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Thank you for recently deciding to become a sponsor of Compassion. Thank you for your commitment to a child in extreme poverty. That’s how we change the world - one child after another.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   We hope you have received the information package and have had time to read through the materials so that you are well-informed about your sponsorship.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   On our website, www.compassion.ch, you will find many testimonies that show the effectiveness of sponsorship.\n"
"   <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/en/jennifer/\">\n"
"    For example, Jennifer\n"
"   </a>\n"
"   and further information about the program can be found under the heading, “Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)”.  If you have any questions, please do not hesitate to contact us directly.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   We wish you much joy with your sponsorship of <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Best regards,\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27;\">\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <t t-out=\"object.user_id.preferred_name\"></t><t t-out=\"object.user_id.lastname\"></t>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <t t-out=\"object.user_id.employee_ids.department_id.name\"></t>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <t t-out=\"object.user_id.company_id.address_name\"></t>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"PS: Do you already have the Compassion App? With it you always have your godchild's pictures, letters and all information with you. And the letter writing is made even easier. Download here: www.compassion.ch/app\n"
"</t>\n"
"  </p>\n"
" </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"  \n"
"<t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects().mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    \n"
"<t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), False)\"/>\n"
"    \n"
"<t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Danke, dass Sie sich vor kurzem entschieden haben, sich mit einer Patenschaft bei Compassion zu engagieren. Danke, dass Sie sich für <t t-out=\"&#x27;ein Kind&#x27; if len(child) == 1 else &#x27;mehrere Kinder&#x27;\"></t> in extremer Armut einsetzen werden. So verändern wir die Welt. Ein Kind nach dem anderen.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Wir hoffen, dass Sie alle Informationen erhalten haben und Zeit hatten sie anzuschauen, damit die <t t-out=\"&#x27;Patenschaft&#x27; if len(child) == 1 else &#x27;Patenschaften&#x27;\"></t> gut <t t-out=\"&#x27;beginnt&#x27; if len(child) == 1 else &#x27;beginnen&#x27;\"></t>.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Auf unserer Internetseite <a href=\"https://my.compassion.ch/r/mbK\" style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: skyblue\">www.compassion.ch</a> finden Sie viele Zeugnisse, die die Wirksamkeit einer Patenschaft zeigen (z.B. dieses hier von Jennifer: <a href=\"https://my.compassion.ch/r/GWZ\" style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: skyblue\">https://compassion.ch/de/jennifer/</a>) und weitere Informationen zum Patenschaftsprogramm, auch unter der Rubrik „Häufig gestellte Fragen (FAQ)“. Wenn Sie Fragen haben, zögern Sie nicht, uns sofort zu kontaktieren.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Wir wünschen Ihnen viel Freude mit der Patenschaft für <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Freundliche Grüsse\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27;\">\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.short_signature\"></t>\n"
"</t>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>PS: Haben Sie die Compassion App schon? Damit haben Sie die Bilder, Briefe und alle Infos Ihres Patenkindes immer auf dem Handy dabei. Und können noch einfacher einen Brief scheiben. Hier downloaden: www.compassion.ch/de/app\n"
"  </p>\n"
" </body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.email_sponsorship_anniversary_1
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"   <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), False)\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Congratulations!\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Now it‘s already been a year since you have gotten to know <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> and supported <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"></t> as a sponsor.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Thank you for your commitment to  <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>. With your help, <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;his&#x27;)\"></t> life has changed.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Together with you as a sponsor, Compassion and 8,700 local churches; we are releasing 2.3 million children from extreme poverty.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Thank you!\n"
"  </p>\n"
" <t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dein\" t-value=\"&#x27;euer&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dein&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, deine + &quot; Patenkinder&quot;, False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Herzlichen Glückwunsch!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Nun ist es schon ein Jahr her, seitdem <t t-out=\"du\"></t> <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> kennengelernt <t t-out=\"&#x27;habt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;hast&#x27;\"></t> und <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;ihn&#x27;)\"></t> als\n"
"    <t t-if=\"plural\">\n"
"        Paten\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        <t t-out=\"&#x27;Pate&#x27; if object.partner_id.gender == &#x27;M&#x27; else &#x27;Patin&#x27;\"></t>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    unterstützt.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Dank <t t-out=\"deine\"></t>r Hilfe  wird <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;sein&#x27;)\"></t> Leben verändert.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Gemeinsam mit <t t-out=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"></t> und rund <t t-out=\"number_fcps\"></t> Partnerkirchen vor Ort befreien wir zurzeit mehr als <t t-out=\"number_children\"></t> Millionen Kinder aus extremer Armut. Das ist ein Grund zum Feiern!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Vielen Dank!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Liebe Grüsse\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.email_sponsorship_anniversary_10
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"   <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), False)\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   Can you believe it‘s been 10 years since you have been sponsoring <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>? Congratulations for your wonderful commitment!\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Through your dedication, the life of <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> has already changed tremendously. After more than 70 years of experience with child sponsorships, we know that long-term commitment brings lasting sustainable benefits. <t t-out=\"object.success_sentence or &#x27;&#x27;\"></t>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   We thank you greatly for believing with us that poverty does not have to be predestined. And that the life of a child, their family and the local community will change if we invest in a child‘s life.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   With Warmest Regards,\n"
"  </p>\n"
" <t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"less_4\" t-value=\"firstname != child.get_number()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dein\" t-value=\"&#x27;euer&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dein&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"&#x27;Könnt ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Kannst du&#x27;\"></t> es glauben, dass <t t-out=\"du\"></t> <t t-out=\"firstname if less_4 else deine + &quot;\n"
"    Patenkinder&quot;\"></t> nun schon seit 10 Jahren <t t-out=\"&#x27;unterstützt und helft&#x27; if plural else &#x27;unterstützst und hilfst&#x27;\"></t>,\n"
"    <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;ihn&#x27;)\"></t> aus extremer Armut zu befreien? Das ist fantastisch!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Mit <t t-out=\"years_lc\"></t> <t t-out=\"number_years\"></t> Jahren Erfahrung mit Kinderpatenschaften wissen wir, dass ein langfristiges\n"
"    Engagement das Leben eines Kindes nachhaltig verändert. <t t-out=\"deine.title()\"></t> Investition in das Leben <t t-out=\"&#x27;von&#x27; if\n"
"    less_4 else &#x27;&#x27;\"></t> <t t-out=\"firstname if less_4 else deine + &quot;r Patenkinder&quot;\"></t> schenkt <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;ihm&#x27;)\"></t> Hoffnung auf ein\n"
"    Leben ohne Armut. Und das nicht nur für sich selbst, sondern für die ganze Familie und <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;sein&#x27;)\"></t> Umfeld.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Danke, dass <t t-out=\"du\"></t> diesen gewaltigen Unterschied im Leben von <t t-out=\"firstname if less_4 else deine + &quot;n Patenkindern&quot;\"></t> <t t-out=\"&#x27;macht&#x27; if plural else &#x27;machst&#x27;\"></t>!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Liebe Grüsse\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.email_sponsorship_anniversary_15
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"   <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), False)\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   This year, we would like to celebrate a special event with you: 15 years ago, you decided to change a life forever. You decided to sponsor <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>. much has been accomplished since then.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Your loyalty, your generous support and your contact in their lives will continue to change the life of <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> drastically and in a sustainable way.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   We would like to thank you from our hearts for your commitment. Together with you and many sponsors, we are in the process of releasing 2,3 million children from extreme poverty.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Best regards,\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"  </p>\n"
" <t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"less_4\" t-value=\"firstname != child.get_number()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dein\" t-value=\"&#x27;euer&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dein&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Vor 15 Jahren <t t-out=\"&#x27;habt ihr euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;hast du dich&#x27;\"></t> entschieden,\n"
"    <t t-if=\"len(child) == 1\">\n"
"        ein Leben für immer zu verändern - das Leben von <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        Leben für immer zu verändern - das Leben von <t t-out=\"deine\"></t>n Patenkindern.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"&#x27;Überlegt euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Überlege dir&#x27;\"></t> kurz, was seitdem alles passiert ist. Ist das nicht ein Grund für ein riesiges Freudenfest?\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Dank <t t-out=\"deine + &quot;r Patenschaft&quot; if len(child) == 1 else deine + &quot;n Patenschaften&quot;\"></t> <t t-out=\"&#x27;ermöglicht ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;ermöglichst du&#x27;\"></t> <t t-out=\"firstname if less_4 else &quot;den Jugendlichen&quot;\"></t>, Selbstverantwortung zu übernehmen und die eigenen Fähigkeiten weiterzuentwickeln. Das ist die Grundlage für ein eigenständiges Leben voller Hoffnung und mit Zukunft.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Herzlichen Dank für <t t-out=\"deine\"></t> nachhaltige Investition in das Leben von <t t-out=\"firstname if less_4 else deine + &quot;r Patenkinder&quot;\"></t>!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Gemeinsam verändern wir das Leben von Kindern - eins nach dem anderen.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Liebe Grüsse\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.email_sponsorship_anniversary_3
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"   <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), False)\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   We want to celebrate your anniversary together with you!\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   It‘s been 3 years since you decided to support <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> with a sponsorship to free <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"></t> from extreme poverty.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Through your support, you not only provide <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> with solid assistance, but you‘re also expanding the horizon for <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"></t>. Thank you for investing in the contact with your sponsored child!\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Together with you as sponsors, Compassion and 8,700 local churches; we are liberating 2.3 million children from extreme poverty.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Thank you so very much!\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"  </p>\n"
" <t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"less_4\" t-value=\"firstname != child.get_number()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dein\" t-value=\"&#x27;euer&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dein&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Was für ein Freudentag!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Es ist jetzt drei Jahre her, seitdem <t t-out=\"du\"></t> begonnen <t t-out=\"&#x27;habt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;hast&#x27;\"></t>, <t t-out=\"firstname if less_4 else deine + &quot; Patenkinder&quot;\"></t> zu unterstützen, um <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;ihn&#x27;)\"></t> aus extremer Armut zu befreien.  Das ist grossartig!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Durch die Patenschaft <t t-out=\"&#x27;schenkt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;schenkst&#x27;\"></t> <t t-out=\"du\"></t>  <t t-out=\"firstname if less_4 else deine + &quot;n Patenkindern&quot;\"></t>  aber auch Wertschätzung. <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;he&#x27;).title()\"></t>  <t t-out=\"&#x27;weiss&#x27; if len(child) == 1 else &quot;wissen&quot;\"></t>, dass am anderen Ende der Welt sich jemand um <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;ihn&#x27;)\"></t> kümmert.  Das ist ein Geschenk von unbezahlbarem Wert.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Danke, dass <t t-out=\"du\"></t> in das Leben <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;eures Patenkindes&#x27;) if plural else child.get(&#x27;deines Patenkindes&#x27;)\"></t>  <t t-out=\"&#x27;investiert&#x27; if plural else &#x27;investierst&#x27;\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Gemeinsam mit <t t-out=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"></t> und rund <t t-out=\"number_fcps\"></t> lokalen Partnerkirchen vor Ort befreien wir zurzeit mehr als <t t-out=\"number_children\"></t> Millionen Kinder aus extremer Armut.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Liebe Grüsse\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.mail_new_donors_onboarding_postcard_and_magazine
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"is_plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"dir\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if is_plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if is_plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"dich\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if is_plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"hast\" t-value=\"&#x27;habt&#x27; if is_plural else &#x27;hast&#x27;\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"kennst\" t-value=\"&#x27;kennt&#x27; if is_plural else &#x27;kennst&#x27;\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"Melde\" t-value=\"&#x27;Meldet&#x27; if is_plural else &#x27;Melde&#x27;\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"                    Danke!\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"                    Wir freuen uns, <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> das aktuelle Compassion-Magazin zu senden. Einmal pro Jahr berichten wir in diesem Format über den Impact, den wir gemeinsam erreicht haben, was unsere Herausforderungen und Ziele sind und was Menschen im globalen Süden und in der Schweiz bewegt. Viel Freude beim Schmökern und Entdecken!\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"                    Wenn <t t-out=\"du\"></t> Compassion noch nicht <t t-out=\"kennst\"></t>, <t t-out=\"hast\"></t> <t t-out=\"du\"></t> vielleicht noch viele Fragen. <t t-out=\"Melde\"></t> <t t-out=\"dich\"></t> gerne jederzeit bei uns.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"                    Herzliche Grüsse\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"                    Debora Alder-Gasser und das Team von Compassion\n"
"                </p>\n"
"            </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dir\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dich\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"hast\" t-value=\"&#x27;habt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;hast&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"kennst\" t-value=\"&#x27;kennt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;kennst&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"Melde\" t-value=\"&#x27;Meldet&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Melde&#x27;\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Wir freuen uns, <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> das aktuelle\n"
"\n"
"    <t t-if=\"partner.country_id.name != &#x27;Schweiz&#x27; and partner.country_id.name != False and partner.country_id.name != &#x27;Liechtenstein&#x27;\">\n"
"        <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/de/downloads/?e-filter-e27dc5c-download-cat=newsletter-de\">Compassion-Magazin</a>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"         Compassion-Magazin\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    zu senden. Einmal pro Jahr berichten wir in diesem Format über die Auswirkungen, die wir gemeinsam erreicht haben, was unsere Herausforderungen und Ziele sind und was Menschen im globalen Süden und in der Schweiz bewegt. Viel Freude beim Durchblättern und Entdecken!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Wenn <t t-out=\"du\"></t> Fragen zu unserer Organisation und Arbeitsweise <t t-out=\"&#x27;habt, könnt ihr euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;hast, kannst du dich&#x27;\"></t> gerne bei uns melden.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Herzliche Grüsse\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.mail_new_donors_onboarding_2nd_blog_post
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><p>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"is_plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"dir\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if is_plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if is_plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"du_upper\" t-value=\"&#x27;Ihr&#x27; if is_plural else &#x27;Du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"dich\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if is_plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if is_plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"findest\" t-value=\"&#x27;findet&#x27; if is_plural else &#x27;findest&#x27;\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"fragst\" t-value=\"&#x27;fragt&#x27; if is_plural else &#x27;fragst&#x27;\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"base_url\" t-value=\"object.env[&#x27;ir.config_parameter&#x27;].sudo().get_param(&#x27;web.external.url&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"du_upper\"></t> <t t-out=\"fragst\"></t> <t t-out=\"dich\"></t> vielleicht: \"Kinderpatenschaften kommen mir ein bisschen altmodisch vor. Sind sie wirklich noch relevant?\"\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Es wird <t t-out=\"dich\"></t> wahrscheinlich nicht überraschen, dass wir hier bei Compassion sagen, dass Kinderpatenschaften relevanter sind als je zuvor. Mit fast 70 Jahren Erfahrung glauben wir immer noch, dass eine Kinderpatenschaft eine lohnenswerte Investition ist, die effektiv, nachhaltig und engagiert ist - sogar in Krisenzeiten wie einer globalen Pandemie. Aber warum? Lass es uns gemeinsam auspacken.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    <!-- TODO add link      -->\n"
"                    <a href=\"#\">Weiterlesen</a>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Hier <t t-out=\"findest\"></t> <t t-out=\"du\"></t> Kinder, für die wir gerade dringend einen Paten oder eine Patin suchen.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/de/finden-sie-ein-patenkind/?utm_event=sponsorshipheaderbutton\">Ja, ich möchte ein Kind mit einer Patenschaft unterstützen</a>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Nochmals vielen Dank, denn gemeinsam verändern wir das Leben von Kindern - eins nach dem anderen.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Herzliche Grüsse\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Debora Alder-Gasser und das Team von Compassion\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Du erhältst diese E-Mail, weil du gemeinsam mit Compassion Schweiz gegen extreme Armut kämpfst und die Arbeit mit einer Spende unterstützt hast. Du kannst dich jederzeit vom <a t-attf-href=\"{{base_url}}/onboarding/new_donors/unsubscribe/{{partner.onboarding_new_donor_hash}}\">Nachrichtenversand abmelden</a>.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"            </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dir\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"du_upper\" t-value=\"&#x27;Ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dich\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"findest\" t-value=\"&#x27;findet&#x27; if plural else &#x27;findest&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"fragst\" t-value=\"&#x27;fragt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;fragst&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"base_url\" t-value=\"object.env[&#x27;ir.config_parameter&#x27;].sudo().get_param(&#x27;web.external.url&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children_in_poverty\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;children_in_poverty&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"early_deaths\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;early_deaths&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_mothers\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_mothers&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_unacceptable_conditions\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_unacceptable_conditions&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Seit über <t t-out=\"number_years\"></t> Jahren sind wir überzeugt, dass Kinderpatenschaften ein effektives Instrument sind, damit Kinder und ihre Familien extreme Armut überwinden können. Doch beinhaltet unsere Arbeit weit mehr als Kinderpatenschaften.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Dazu gehören zum Beispiel der Bau und die Gewährleistung von sicheren Toiletten und sauberem Trinkwasser, das Überlebensprogramm für Mütter und Babys, Ausbildungsprogramme und Nothilfe.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Als Compassion Schweiz haben wir uns neben den Kinderpatenschaften 3 Schwerpunkte gesetzt.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        Wir helfen mit, die Kinder- und Müttersterblichkeit durch das Überlebensprogramm für Mütter und ihre Babys zu bekämpfen. Dafür kannst du auch eine unpersönliche <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/de/mutter-und-babys-patenschaft/\">Patenschaft für eine Mutter und ihr Baby</a> übernehmen.\n"
"    </li>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        Wir nehmen die Schweizer Tradition der Berufsbildungen ernst und ermöglichen <a href=\"http://compassion.ch/ausbildung\">Ausbildungsplätze für Jugendliche</a> im globalen Süden.\n"
"    </li>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        Wir ermöglichen <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/de/sichere-toiletten-retten-leben/\">Zugänge zu sicheren Toiletten und sauberem Trinkwasser</a> für Kinder und ihre Familien im globalen Süden.\n"
"    </li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Nochmals vielen Dank, denn gemeinsam verändern wir das Leben von Kindern - eins nach dem anderen.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"&#x27;Folgt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Folge&#x27;\"></t> uns auf Social Media, um Neuigkeiten und spannende Updates zu unseren Projekten bei Compassion zu erhalten!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Herzliche Grüsse\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"&#x27;Ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Du&#x27;\"></t> <t t-out=\"&#x27;erhaltet&#x27; if plural else &#x27;erhältst&#x27;\"></t> diese E-Mail, weil <t t-out=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"></t> gemeinsam mit Compassion Schweiz gegen extreme Armut <t t-out=\"&#x27;kämpft&#x27; if plural else &#x27;kämpfst&#x27;\"></t> und die Arbeit mit einer Spende unterstützt <t t-out=\"&#x27;habt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;hast&#x27;\"></t>. <t t-out=\"&#x27;Ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Du&#x27;\"></t> <t t-out=\"&#x27;könnt euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;kannst dich&#x27;\"></t> jederzeit vom <a t-attf-href=\"{{base_url}}/onboarding/new_donors/unsubscribe/{{partner.onboarding_new_donor_hash}}\">Nachrichtenversand abmelden</a>.\n"
"</p></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.mail_new_donors_onboarding_1st_blog_post
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><p>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"is_plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"dir\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if is_plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if is_plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"du_upper\" t-value=\"&#x27;Ihr&#x27; if is_plural else &#x27;Du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"dich\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if is_plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if is_plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"hast\" t-value=\"&#x27;habt&#x27; if is_plural else &#x27;hast&#x27;\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"fragst\" t-value=\"&#x27;fragt&#x27; if is_plural else &#x27;fragst&#x27;\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"base_url\" t-value=\"object.env[&#x27;ir.config_parameter&#x27;].sudo().get_param(&#x27;web.external.url&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Wir freuen uns, <t t-out=\"dich\"></t> kennenzulernen und <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> mehr davon zu erzählen, wie wir Kinder und Familien unterstützen, extreme Armut zu überwinden. <t t-out=\"du_upper\"></t> <t t-out=\"fragst\"></t> <t t-out=\"dich\"></t> vielleicht, was Kinderpatenschaften bringen, vielleicht sogar, ob sie sinnvoll sind oder ob nur christliche Kinder unterstützt werden? Gerne nehmen wir <t t-out=\"dich\"></t> mit und beantworten <t t-out=\"deine\"></t> Fragen.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    <!-- TODO add link -->\n"
"                    <a href=\"#\">Weiterlesen</a>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Nochmals vielen Dank: mit <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> zusammen befreien wir zurzeit mit rund 8'700 Partnerkirchen in 29 Ländern 2,3 Millionen Kinder aus extremer Armut. Gemeinsam ermöglichen wir den Kindern ein Leben mit Hoffnung und Zukunft.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Herzliche Grüsse\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Debora Alder-Gasser und das Team von Compassion\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Du erhältst diese E-Mail, weil du gemeinsam mit Compassion Schweiz gegen extreme Armut kämpfst und die Arbeit mit einer Spende unterstützt hast. Du kannst dich jederzeit vom <a t-attf-href=\"{{base_url}}/onboarding/new_donors/unsubscribe/{{partner.onboarding_new_donor_hash}}\">Nachrichtenversand abmelden</a>.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"            </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dir\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"du_upper\" t-value=\"&#x27;Ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dich\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"hast\" t-value=\"&#x27;habt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;hast&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"fragst\" t-value=\"&#x27;fragt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;fragst&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"base_url\" t-value=\"object.env[&#x27;ir.config_parameter&#x27;].sudo().get_param(&#x27;web.external.url&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children_in_poverty\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;children_in_poverty&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"early_deaths\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;early_deaths&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_mothers\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_mothers&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_unacceptable_conditions\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_unacceptable_conditions&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Ich freue mich, <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> aufgrund <t t-out=\"deine\"></t>r Spende in dieser und der nächsten E-Mail einen Blick hinter die Kulissen unserer Arbeit zu geben.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <b>Kein Kind sollte in Armut leben.</b> Das ist das, was uns täglich in unserer Arbeit antreibt. Gerne erzählen wir <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> mehr von unserem Herz für Kinder in extremer Armut und wie wir uns mit unseren lokalen Partnern dafür einsetzen, dass sie und ihre Familien Armut überwinden können.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div style=\"margin:30px auto; text-align: center;  text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"    <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/de/neu-bei-compassion/\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"        Hier <t t-out=\"&#x27;erfahrt ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;erfährst du&#x27;\"></t> mehr dazu.\n"
"    </a>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Nochmals vielen Dank für <t t-out=\"deine\"></t> Spende! Gemeinsam verändern wir nachhaltig das Leben von <t t-out=\"number_children\"></t> Millionen Kindern in <t t-out=\"number_countries\"></t> Ländern.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Herzliche Grüsse\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"&#x27;Ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Du&#x27;\"></t> <t t-out=\"&#x27;erhaltet&#x27; if plural else &#x27;erhältst&#x27;\"></t> diese E-Mail, weil <t t-out=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"></t> gemeinsam mit Compassion Schweiz gegen extreme Armut <t t-out=\"&#x27;kämpft&#x27; if plural else &#x27;kämpfst&#x27;\"></t> und die Arbeit mit einer Spende unterstützt <t t-out=\"&#x27;habt&#x27; if plural else &#x27;hast&#x27;\"></t>. <t t-out=\"&#x27;Ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Du&#x27;\"></t> <t t-out=\"&#x27;könnt euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;kannst dich&#x27;\"></t> jederzeit vom <a t-attf-href=\"{{base_url}}/onboarding/new_donors/unsubscribe/{{partner.onboarding_new_donor_hash}}\">Nachrichtenversand abmelden</a>.\n"
"</p></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.email_sponsorship_certificate
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><p>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"name\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&quot;child_id&quot;).get_list(&quot;preferred_name&quot;)\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    We recently informed you by email about the end of the sponsorship of <t t-out=\"name\"></t>.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    From the bottom of our hearts, we would like to thank you for your valuable contribution!\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Best regards\n"
"                </p>\n"
"            </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dir\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dich\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dein\" t-value=\"&#x27;euer&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dein&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"name\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&quot;child_id&quot;).get_list(&quot;preferred_name&quot;)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Vor Kurzem haben wir <t t-out=\"dich\"></t> per E-Mail über das Ende der Patenschaft von <t t-out=\"name\"></t> informiert.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Von ganzem Herzen möchten wir <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> hiermit für <t t-out=\"deine\"></t>n wertvollen Einsatz danken!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Liebe Grüsse\n"
"</p>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

